WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club

﻿1

00:01:24.792 --> 00:01:26.792
(wind blowing)


00:01:32.626 --> 00:01:34.626
♪♪


00:01:58.584 --> 00:02:00.584
♪♪


00:02:25.292 --> 00:02:27.292
(cracking)


00:02:51.251 --> 00:02:53.251
♪♪


00:03:19.584 --> 00:03:21.584
♪♪


00:03:46.417 --> 00:03:48.084
It's prettier this way.


00:03:51.917 --> 00:03:53.834
Wanna know a secret?


00:03:54.001 --> 00:03:54.834
Yes.


00:04:06.459 --> 00:04:07.751
Wake up.


00:04:08.209 --> 00:04:09.542
Wake up!


00:04:11.167 --> 00:04:13.292
So, what's the secret?


00:04:17.626 --> 00:04:19.459
I caught something…


00:04:21.084 --> 00:04:23.709
("Roads" by Portishead playing)


00:04:23.792 --> 00:04:26.001
(gasps)


00:04:26.084 --> 00:04:27.584
Wow.


00:04:29.084 --> 00:04:30.209
(laughs)


00:04:52.209 --> 00:04:54.209
♪♪


00:05:13.001 --> 00:05:14.542
<i>♪ Oh ♪</i>


00:05:15.834 --> 00:05:18.876
<i>♪ Can't anybody see? ♪</i>


00:05:23.001 --> 00:05:26.876
<i>♪ We've got a war to fight ♪</i>


00:05:28.001 --> 00:05:31.501
<i>♪ Never find our way ♪</i>


00:05:32.501 --> 00:05:37.751
<i>♪ Regardless of what they say ♪</i>


00:05:37.834 --> 00:05:40.876
<i>♪ How can it feel ♪</i>


00:05:42.126 --> 00:05:44.417
<i>♪ This wrong? ♪</i>


00:05:48.084 --> 00:05:51.001
<i>♪ From this moment ♪</i>


00:05:51.084 --> 00:05:53.001
<i>♪ How can it feel ♪</i>


00:05:53.084 --> 00:05:54.459
(indistinct chatter
in background)


00:05:54.542 --> 00:05:57.084
<i>♪ This wrong? ♪</i>


00:06:01.001 --> 00:06:03.376
(exhales deeply)


00:06:03.459 --> 00:06:05.834
<i>♪ Storm ♪</i>


00:06:05.917 --> 00:06:09.626
<i>♪ In the morning light ♪</i>


00:06:10.709 --> 00:06:12.209
<i>♪ I feel ♪</i>


00:06:12.292 --> 00:06:13.709
(sighs)


00:06:13.792 --> 00:06:16.584
<i>♪ No more ♪</i>


00:06:16.667 --> 00:06:19.042
<i>♪ Can I say ♪</i>


00:06:21.209 --> 00:06:22.292
(laughter, indistinct chatter)


00:06:22.376 --> 00:06:26.376
<i>♪ Frozen to myself ♪</i>


00:06:26.459 --> 00:06:27.751
(mutters)


00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:30.959
<i>♪ I got nobody on my side ♪</i>


00:06:31.042 --> 00:06:34.292
- (boy whoops)
<i>- ♪ And surely that ain't right ♪</i>


00:06:34.376 --> 00:06:36.376
(yelling in French)


00:06:44.417 --> 00:06:48.167
<i>♪ Surely that ain't right ♪</i>


00:06:50.792 --> 00:06:52.376
(girl laughs)


00:06:54.001 --> 00:06:55.042
<i>♪ Oh ♪</i>


00:06:55.126 --> 00:06:56.376
Where's Adrien?


00:06:56.459 --> 00:07:00.417
<i>♪ Can't anybody see? ♪</i>


00:07:02.834 --> 00:07:03.834
(muffled chatter)


00:07:03.917 --> 00:07:07.626
<i>♪ We've got a war to fight ♪</i>


00:07:09.084 --> 00:07:12.334
<i>♪ Never find our way ♪</i>


00:07:13.459 --> 00:07:18.251
<i>♪ Regardless of what they say ♪</i>


00:07:19.251 --> 00:07:22.834
<i>♪ How can it feel ♪</i>


00:07:22.917 --> 00:07:25.584
<i>♪ This wrong? ♪</i>


00:07:29.126 --> 00:07:31.751
<i>♪ From this moment ♪</i>


00:07:31.834 --> 00:07:35.376
<i>♪ How can it feel ♪</i>


00:07:35.459 --> 00:07:38.292
<i>♪ This wrong? ♪</i>


00:07:38.376 --> 00:07:39.376
Alpha!


00:07:58.792 --> 00:08:00.792
♪♪


00:08:09.626 --> 00:08:13.167
<i>♪ How can it feel ♪</i>


00:08:13.251 --> 00:08:15.667
<i>♪ This wrong? ♪</i>


00:08:18.126 --> 00:08:19.126
Come on.


00:08:19.501 --> 00:08:21.751
Wake up. Open your eyes.


00:08:23.417 --> 00:08:24.542
Alpha…


00:08:27.376 --> 00:08:28.626
Still love me?


00:08:29.709 --> 00:08:31.459
I had a long day, Alpha.


00:08:32.209 --> 00:08:34.417
Say yes,
the only answer is yes!


00:08:34.584 --> 00:08:36.459
Yes, I do, of course I do!


00:08:41.126 --> 00:08:43.126
(retches)


00:08:49.626 --> 00:08:51.084
Help me, honey.


00:08:51.667 --> 00:08:52.667
Mum,


00:08:53.084 --> 00:08:55.751
remember how Flipper
used to jump on us


00:08:55.917 --> 00:08:57.459
whenever we came home?


00:08:57.584 --> 00:08:58.667
Mm.


00:08:58.751 --> 00:09:01.209
Well, whenever I come home,


00:09:01.376 --> 00:09:05.417
I still step back as if he were
about to jump on me.


00:09:05.584 --> 00:09:08.042
I don't know how
to make it stop.


00:09:09.209 --> 00:09:10.751
Why do you want it to stop?


00:09:14.292 --> 00:09:15.834
(Alpha winces)


00:09:17.292 --> 00:09:18.209
What's this?


00:09:18.334 --> 00:09:19.459
(winces)


00:09:19.542 --> 00:09:20.376
What?


00:09:20.459 --> 00:09:22.126
How did you get it?


00:09:22.292 --> 00:09:23.584
Did you go to a store?


00:09:23.751 --> 00:09:24.751
What store?


00:09:24.917 --> 00:09:26.459
A tattoo parlour, I don't know!


00:09:26.626 --> 00:09:28.584
Who did it to you? With what?


00:09:28.751 --> 00:09:30.209
I don't know!


00:09:30.501 --> 00:09:33.292
Some random guy,
we were at his place.


00:09:33.459 --> 00:09:34.917
Describe the needle.


00:09:35.084 --> 00:09:36.834
Did he use it on anyone else?


00:09:37.001 --> 00:09:38.042
- It was sharp…
- F…!


00:09:38.167 --> 00:09:39.917
(groans)


00:09:42.417 --> 00:09:44.167
Was it clean or dirty?


00:09:44.334 --> 00:09:45.876
Where did it come from?


00:09:46.334 --> 00:09:48.084
A drawer, I think.


00:09:59.251 --> 00:10:01.584
You'll come to the hospital
with me tomorrow.


00:10:03.001 --> 00:10:04.959
You need a tetanus booster.


00:10:06.542 --> 00:10:08.459
We can't test you just yet.


00:10:09.167 --> 00:10:10.376
Keep still!


00:10:12.334 --> 00:10:13.459
Test me for what?


00:10:19.042 --> 00:10:20.042
(groans)


00:10:25.292 --> 00:10:26.667
(door opens)


00:10:29.917 --> 00:10:31.542
This can't go on.


00:10:32.792 --> 00:10:34.959
First you, now her.
It'll kill me.


00:10:36.459 --> 00:10:37.584
Yet again.


00:10:40.459 --> 00:10:42.626
I can't keep fighting,
I'm worn out.


00:10:44.959 --> 00:10:46.501
Close the door, please.


00:10:56.626 --> 00:10:58.626
- (wind blowing)
- (scaffolding rattling)


00:11:15.876 --> 00:11:17.334
(winces)


00:11:17.417 --> 00:11:18.501
Fuck…


00:11:23.001 --> 00:11:24.209
(keys jingle)


00:11:28.167 --> 00:11:30.501
- (wind blowing)
- (scaffolding rattling)


00:11:37.084 --> 00:11:38.917
(gasps)


00:12:01.334 --> 00:12:04.209
(rattling intensifies)


00:12:16.501 --> 00:12:17.959
(gasps)


00:12:26.876 --> 00:12:28.501
(pants)


00:12:32.501 --> 00:12:34.917
(gasps)


00:12:38.542 --> 00:12:39.667
Mummy…


00:12:43.292 --> 00:12:45.792
Mummy! Mummy!


00:12:48.792 --> 00:12:49.751
Mum, come!


00:12:52.292 --> 00:12:53.292
Alpha!


00:12:53.792 --> 00:12:55.709
- Alpha!
- (taps twice)


00:12:55.792 --> 00:12:56.792
(Alpha panting)


00:12:56.876 --> 00:12:58.001
Take my hand.


00:12:59.084 --> 00:13:00.251
Take my hand.


00:13:01.042 --> 00:13:02.126
Look at me.


00:13:02.292 --> 00:13:03.376
- Look at me!
- (taps twice)


00:13:06.501 --> 00:13:07.459
That's it.


00:13:08.626 --> 00:13:09.792
That's it, come.


00:13:12.667 --> 00:13:15.292
- (Alpha sighs)
- (Mum grunts)


00:13:19.417 --> 00:13:20.417
Come here.


00:13:35.751 --> 00:13:38.459
Sorry, Mummy.


00:13:39.542 --> 00:13:40.792
I'm so sorry.


00:13:42.209 --> 00:13:43.209
Sorry.


00:13:43.792 --> 00:13:45.626
(panting)


00:13:59.584 --> 00:14:02.209
(singing "A Vava Inouva" in Kabyle)


00:14:33.501 --> 00:14:35.501
(continues singing)


00:14:55.459 --> 00:14:58.209
(continues singing)


00:15:12.459 --> 00:15:14.459
(siren wailing in distance)


00:15:14.542 --> 00:15:16.542
(wrapper crinkling)


00:15:25.251 --> 00:15:27.292
(mutters)


00:15:27.376 --> 00:15:28.209
Okay.


00:15:28.626 --> 00:15:29.501
Truce!


00:15:29.792 --> 00:15:30.626
Two seconds.


00:15:30.917 --> 00:15:32.709
- You okay?
- (stammers)


00:15:32.792 --> 00:15:34.209
I don't love this.


00:15:35.251 --> 00:15:36.501
No one does.


00:15:36.667 --> 00:15:37.584
C'mon.


00:15:37.751 --> 00:15:38.626
I can't, I can't!


00:15:38.792 --> 00:15:40.584
Pretend I'm not here.


00:15:40.751 --> 00:15:42.001
I can't, you are here!


00:15:42.167 --> 00:15:43.834
Rather do it yourself?


00:15:44.167 --> 00:15:45.042
What?


00:15:45.209 --> 00:15:46.501
Are you crazy?


00:15:47.292 --> 00:15:49.834
You insert the needle,
I inject the vaccine.


00:15:49.959 --> 00:15:51.876
(grunts)


00:15:51.959 --> 00:15:52.959
Hmm?


00:15:53.042 --> 00:15:54.501
Does my mum know?


00:15:54.834 --> 00:15:56.001
We don't have to tell.


00:15:56.167 --> 00:15:59.626
Yes, we do. Otherwise
it must be wrong and dangerous!


00:15:59.792 --> 00:16:01.876
Okay, we'll tell her. Deal?


00:16:07.584 --> 00:16:08.501
That's better.


00:16:09.376 --> 00:16:10.209
Do it here.


00:16:11.417 --> 00:16:13.542
- Here?
- Mm-hmm.


00:16:13.626 --> 00:16:16.626
(panting)


00:16:16.709 --> 00:16:18.084
(groans)


00:16:18.167 --> 00:16:19.834
That's it. Perfect.


00:16:20.209 --> 00:16:21.709
See? Not so bad.


00:16:22.417 --> 00:16:23.459
That's it?


00:16:23.626 --> 00:16:24.501
Yeah.


00:16:25.251 --> 00:16:26.251
All done.


00:16:28.751 --> 00:16:30.876
But Mum mentioned a test.


00:16:31.584 --> 00:16:34.709
Yes, but we're done for now.
I'll see you in two weeks.


00:16:36.501 --> 00:16:37.584
What's it for?


00:16:40.417 --> 00:16:42.542
You know about the virus, right?


00:16:43.292 --> 00:16:44.251
But…


00:16:46.084 --> 00:16:47.501
I'm only 13.


00:16:49.251 --> 00:16:50.876
<i>(elevator door opens)</i>


00:16:56.292 --> 00:16:58.292
(elevator door closing)


00:17:22.167 --> 00:17:24.167
(footfalls approaching)


00:17:26.917 --> 00:17:27.917
Eh?


00:17:29.417 --> 00:17:31.167
Where'd they all go?


00:17:36.959 --> 00:17:39.959
Those are last night's meals
on the cart. No one got them?


00:17:40.126 --> 00:17:42.042
I don't work on this floor.


00:17:42.209 --> 00:17:43.959
You work at this hospital, right?


00:17:44.042 --> 00:17:45.209
This isn't my floor either.


00:17:45.376 --> 00:17:46.792
Save your energy.


00:17:46.959 --> 00:17:48.376
I don't feel guilty.


00:17:49.501 --> 00:17:50.709
Everyone left.


00:17:51.084 --> 00:17:52.876
Everyone. It was just me.


00:17:53.042 --> 00:17:54.792
I was useless on my own.


00:17:54.959 --> 00:17:57.584
Say what you like,
at least I'm still here!


00:17:57.751 --> 00:17:59.084
So they can't count on anyone?


00:17:59.667 --> 00:18:00.792
Nor can we.


00:18:01.167 --> 00:18:03.084
(patient coughs)


00:18:03.167 --> 00:18:05.167
(monitor beeping steadily)


00:18:08.834 --> 00:18:10.501
Sorry, it's cold.


00:18:10.792 --> 00:18:12.376
Your doctor is coming.


00:18:16.626 --> 00:18:18.626
(coughing)


00:18:20.584 --> 00:18:22.167
Sorry, it's cold.


00:18:22.334 --> 00:18:23.834
Your doctor is coming.


00:18:23.917 --> 00:18:25.751
(others coughing)


00:18:25.834 --> 00:18:27.834
(flatlining tone nearby)


00:18:31.209 --> 00:18:32.626
Sorry, it's cold.


00:18:32.792 --> 00:18:34.501
Your doctor is coming.


00:18:37.126 --> 00:18:39.126
(flatlining continues)


00:19:03.209 --> 00:19:05.209
(flatlining continues)


00:19:28.834 --> 00:19:30.542
(flatlining stops)


00:19:30.626 --> 00:19:32.209
(other monitors beeping steadily)


00:19:51.126 --> 00:19:52.667
TEACHER:
"I stand amid the roar


00:19:52.751 --> 00:19:55.209
"Of a surf-tormented shore,


00:19:55.292 --> 00:19:57.709
"And I hold within my hand


00:19:57.792 --> 00:20:02.334
- (door opens)
- "Grains of the golden sand —


00:20:02.417 --> 00:20:03.417
How few…"


00:20:03.501 --> 00:20:05.042
Alpha, hello, good morning.


00:20:05.126 --> 00:20:10.209
"How few! yet how they creep


00:20:10.292 --> 00:20:11.917
"Through my fingers
to the deep,


00:20:12.001 --> 00:20:15.126
"While I weep — while I weep!


00:20:15.209 --> 00:20:17.959
"O God! can I not grasp


00:20:18.042 --> 00:20:19.792
"Them with a tighter clasp?


00:20:19.876 --> 00:20:22.542
O God! can I not save"


00:20:23.542 --> 00:20:26.542
"One from the pitiless wave?


00:20:26.626 --> 00:20:30.876
"Is all that we see or seem


00:20:30.959 --> 00:20:34.501
But a dream within a dream?"


00:20:37.626 --> 00:20:41.792
So, using any words you
hopefully know from the list


00:20:42.209 --> 00:20:44.001
and the visuals,


00:20:44.167 --> 00:20:46.209
what happens to the narrator?


00:20:46.834 --> 00:20:49.292
Dude's having
an existential crisis.


00:20:49.709 --> 00:20:52.251
Yes, good.
What makes you say that?


00:20:53.084 --> 00:20:54.167
He cries a lot.


00:20:54.334 --> 00:20:56.792
- Says, "O God, O God."
- Yeah, "O God."


00:20:56.876 --> 00:20:58.417
He's one big victim.


00:20:58.501 --> 00:20:59.792
(students laughing)


00:20:59.876 --> 00:21:01.542
Uh…


00:21:01.626 --> 00:21:05.126
Can you understand
why the guy is crying?


00:21:06.376 --> 00:21:07.709
I don't know.


00:21:07.876 --> 00:21:08.959
'Cause he's gay?


00:21:09.084 --> 00:21:10.876
(students murmuring)


00:21:11.792 --> 00:21:15.501
I don't see the connection.
Where do you get that from?


00:21:15.667 --> 00:21:17.459
There's no mention of it.


00:21:18.126 --> 00:21:21.459
Well, you read it
like the dude was whining,


00:21:21.626 --> 00:21:24.584
even though he's chilling
on a beach. No one dies.


00:21:24.751 --> 00:21:26.834
Actually, someone does die.


00:21:27.667 --> 00:21:28.834
Someone does die.


00:21:28.917 --> 00:21:30.167
"The pitiless wave."


00:21:30.251 --> 00:21:31.251
(speaks French)


00:21:31.334 --> 00:21:32.417
And the "grains
of the golden sand."


00:21:32.501 --> 00:21:34.834
That's your perception.


00:21:35.126 --> 00:21:37.251
We don't have
to think like you.


00:21:37.334 --> 00:21:39.501
(students murmuring)


00:21:39.584 --> 00:21:41.959
Okay, so explain.


00:21:42.459 --> 00:21:45.459
Dunno, you read it
in a weird way.


00:21:45.584 --> 00:21:48.501
Ah, okay.
So I'm the problem, is that it?


00:21:48.834 --> 00:21:52.292
What made it weird?
Repeat what you said before.


00:21:54.751 --> 00:21:56.459
Well, you sound faggy.


00:21:56.542 --> 00:21:59.042
- STUDENT: Oh!
- (others murmuring)


00:22:04.334 --> 00:22:06.042
Good, good, good, jolly good.


00:22:10.667 --> 00:22:11.751
Right…


00:22:11.834 --> 00:22:12.834
Um…


00:22:13.209 --> 00:22:15.584
Alpha, will you give me
your late slip


00:22:15.751 --> 00:22:17.042
and tell us…


00:22:17.959 --> 00:22:19.626
what you think, please?


00:22:21.042 --> 00:22:23.626
As for you,
we'll talk after class.


00:22:25.084 --> 00:22:26.084
Thank you.


00:22:26.167 --> 00:22:27.709
(students groaning)


00:22:27.792 --> 00:22:30.459
(teacher speaks French)


00:22:30.542 --> 00:22:32.667
Just two minutes.
Be serious, please.


00:22:34.001 --> 00:22:35.876
So, what do you think?


00:22:36.751 --> 00:22:38.626
A dream inside a dream,
he says.


00:22:38.792 --> 00:22:41.126
Okay, good. Expand on that.


00:22:42.126 --> 00:22:44.126
It means everything's fake, right?


00:22:45.167 --> 00:22:46.001
Good.


00:22:46.751 --> 00:22:48.626
Maybe it's just a nightmare.


00:22:49.001 --> 00:22:50.209
- Sir?
- Yes?


00:22:50.376 --> 00:22:52.084
There's blood on the wall.


00:22:53.084 --> 00:22:53.917
Shit.


00:22:54.001 --> 00:22:55.001
(students groan)


00:22:55.084 --> 00:22:56.334
Oh, okay, okay.


00:22:56.417 --> 00:22:57.417
Calm down!


00:22:57.501 --> 00:22:59.334
We're not made of fairy dust.


00:22:59.417 --> 00:23:00.876
What's going on?


00:23:01.042 --> 00:23:03.126
Someone wrote on me.


00:23:04.292 --> 00:23:07.042
Using what? A pen?


00:23:08.376 --> 00:23:09.417
A needle.


00:23:12.751 --> 00:23:14.001
Go see the nurse.


00:23:17.959 --> 00:23:20.667
(students groan, murmur)


00:23:20.751 --> 00:23:23.584
GIRL: Adrien, she doesn't
need you! Stay here!


00:23:24.334 --> 00:23:25.417
Adrien. Adrien!


00:23:25.501 --> 00:23:26.584
ADRIEN:
Leave me alone!


00:23:27.584 --> 00:23:30.334
I'll go with, in case
her arm tragically dies.


00:23:31.334 --> 00:23:32.459
Alph, wait up!


00:23:33.834 --> 00:23:35.959
Shouldn't it have healed
by now?


00:23:36.126 --> 00:23:38.876
It's not some wimp thing
everyone does.


00:23:39.042 --> 00:23:40.792
Still, shouldn't be so gnarly.


00:23:40.917 --> 00:23:43.834
(whistling in distance)


00:23:43.917 --> 00:23:44.834
Wait.


00:23:45.584 --> 00:23:46.834
Hear that?


00:23:48.042 --> 00:23:49.042
What?


00:23:50.876 --> 00:23:53.542
Hide the cigarette,
I heard someone whistle!


00:23:59.751 --> 00:24:00.751
There.


00:24:01.126 --> 00:24:02.292
Did you hear it?


00:24:03.917 --> 00:24:06.042
You're trippin'.
It's the toilets.


00:24:08.917 --> 00:24:10.917
(whistling continues)


00:24:26.459 --> 00:24:28.459
(whistling continues)


00:24:49.417 --> 00:24:50.334
Stop.


00:24:51.917 --> 00:24:52.751
Wait.


00:24:52.876 --> 00:24:53.792
What?


00:24:54.792 --> 00:24:56.251
Y'know, not here.


00:24:57.292 --> 00:24:59.001
Chill, we're just kissing.


00:24:59.167 --> 00:25:01.584
Need flowers
and a room at the Ritz?


00:25:01.751 --> 00:25:04.626
If you touch me there,
I'd rather have condoms.


00:25:04.792 --> 00:25:06.417
What? Never crossed my mind!


00:25:06.584 --> 00:25:08.334
Try telling
your girlfriend that.


00:25:13.376 --> 00:25:14.501
So…


00:25:16.001 --> 00:25:17.251
it crossed your mind?


00:25:18.876 --> 00:25:20.167
I didn't say that.


00:25:24.626 --> 00:25:25.834
I gotta pee.


00:25:28.084 --> 00:25:29.126
(unzips pants)


00:25:30.834 --> 00:25:31.959
Do you mind?


00:25:40.626 --> 00:25:42.001
(backpack thuds)


00:25:54.126 --> 00:25:56.126
♪♪


00:26:18.042 --> 00:26:20.042
♪♪


00:26:22.667 --> 00:26:23.626
(gasps)


00:26:23.917 --> 00:26:26.209
Don't wake me just yet, please.


00:26:29.584 --> 00:26:31.584
(panting)


00:26:32.917 --> 00:26:34.251
(knock at door)


00:26:36.292 --> 00:26:37.917
C'mon, Alpha, open up.


00:26:40.417 --> 00:26:41.751
(knock at door)


00:26:48.042 --> 00:26:49.501
Don't remember me?


00:26:50.751 --> 00:26:52.126
The cops are coming.


00:26:53.042 --> 00:26:55.459
Your mum will be delighted.


00:26:55.542 --> 00:26:56.834
She didn't tell you
I'm crashing here?


00:26:57.084 --> 00:26:58.126
Who are you?


00:26:58.292 --> 00:27:00.459
I told her
your room was a bad idea.


00:27:01.459 --> 00:27:03.584
This family doesn't do
boundaries.


00:27:05.334 --> 00:27:06.917
We're brother and sister.


00:27:08.626 --> 00:27:09.459
Your mum and me.


00:27:09.626 --> 00:27:11.292
Mum only has sisters.


00:27:11.626 --> 00:27:14.376
I may not be mentioned,
but I do exist.


00:27:17.459 --> 00:27:18.876
My grandparents' names?


00:27:20.626 --> 00:27:21.584
Dad…


00:27:21.751 --> 00:27:22.751
and Mum!


00:27:23.542 --> 00:27:24.751
(chuckles)


00:27:27.209 --> 00:27:28.626
Hissu and Ouzna.


00:27:30.584 --> 00:27:33.209
I babysat you once.
Don't remember?


00:27:34.209 --> 00:27:36.376
Know where your mum hides
her cigs?


00:27:36.542 --> 00:27:37.459
Sit!


00:27:39.792 --> 00:27:41.042
Sit, I said!


00:27:42.001 --> 00:27:43.709
Unbelievable!
(laughs)


00:27:49.167 --> 00:27:51.626
- (flicks lighter)
- Stop shaking, what's your problem?


00:27:54.042 --> 00:27:56.751
I'm not in my best shape, honey.


00:27:56.917 --> 00:27:58.792
I'm a little out of focus.


00:27:59.251 --> 00:28:01.126
Why have I never seen you?


00:28:01.459 --> 00:28:05.042
You've seen me, as I said.
I even took you to the beach.


00:28:05.417 --> 00:28:08.459
Enough now.
I remember you far nicer.


00:28:08.667 --> 00:28:10.042
- 20 francs to get lost?
- Mm.


00:28:13.126 --> 00:28:14.209
Cough it up.


00:28:14.376 --> 00:28:15.584
I don't have it, but…


00:28:15.751 --> 00:28:17.001
Back to square one.


00:28:17.167 --> 00:28:18.459
I'll call the cops.


00:28:19.126 --> 00:28:20.792
Thought you already did.


00:28:20.959 --> 00:28:22.751
- Don't you touch me!
- Oh.


00:28:24.042 --> 00:28:25.042
(grunts)


00:28:26.042 --> 00:28:28.251
- (knife clanks)
- I'll be in our room.


00:28:28.334 --> 00:28:29.959
<i>(character speaks French on TV)</i>


00:28:30.042 --> 00:28:32.042
♪♪


00:28:38.834 --> 00:28:40.084
(Amin groans)


00:28:47.959 --> 00:28:49.376
MAN (on TV):
<i>Herr Munchausen,</i>


00:28:49.667 --> 00:28:52.542
<i>- where did everyone else go?
- (whimpers)</i>


00:28:52.626 --> 00:28:55.334
(laughing)


00:28:57.167 --> 00:28:59.542
<i>(man growling on TV)</i>


00:29:01.042 --> 00:29:03.001
<i>We're experiencing precisely
the kind of episode</i>


00:29:03.084 --> 00:29:05.084
<i>- no one believes.</i>
- (door opens)


00:29:06.292 --> 00:29:07.584
Is he your brother?


00:29:07.667 --> 00:29:08.709
(door closes)


00:29:08.792 --> 00:29:09.709
Of course.


00:29:09.876 --> 00:29:11.209
Uncle Amin.


00:29:12.001 --> 00:29:13.459
(kisses)


00:29:14.667 --> 00:29:15.626
The last born.


00:29:15.792 --> 00:29:18.459
First or last, so what!
I thought he was gonna kill me!


00:29:18.626 --> 00:29:21.709
- You didn't explain?
- Sure, but look at my mug!


00:29:22.209 --> 00:29:24.167
Sorry, hon,
didn't mean to scare you.


00:29:24.542 --> 00:29:26.667
I thought you'd remember him.


00:29:27.292 --> 00:29:29.376
- Go on, kiss your uncle.
- Why?


00:29:29.501 --> 00:29:30.334
He's family.


00:29:30.501 --> 00:29:31.334
Since when?


00:29:32.001 --> 00:29:33.209
Let it go.


00:29:33.709 --> 00:29:34.542
Alpha…


00:29:35.292 --> 00:29:37.251
kiss your uncle.


00:29:43.167 --> 00:29:44.084
That's right.


00:29:44.751 --> 00:29:45.834
He can't sleep in my room.


00:29:46.001 --> 00:29:48.042
I won't sleep with my brother.
We're not animals.


00:29:48.209 --> 00:29:51.542
Give him the dog bed! He's
your brother and it's my room!


00:29:51.917 --> 00:29:54.001
- I'll wait over there.
- Stay put.


00:29:55.667 --> 00:29:57.334
Your uncle is not intruding.


00:29:57.501 --> 00:30:01.501
We're not doing him a favour. He
has a right to be here, got it?


00:30:02.334 --> 00:30:04.001
You can sleep with me.


00:30:04.084 --> 00:30:06.459
(stomping)


00:30:06.542 --> 00:30:07.709
(chuckles)


00:30:11.376 --> 00:30:13.376
(Mum laughing)


00:30:13.459 --> 00:30:14.667
(Amin laughing)


00:30:16.709 --> 00:30:18.709
<i>(walking footfalls)</i>


00:30:20.459 --> 00:30:22.959
- (panting)
- (baby crying in distance)


00:30:30.876 --> 00:30:33.334
(dog barking in distance)


00:30:33.417 --> 00:30:34.459
Amin!


00:30:35.834 --> 00:30:37.501
Amin!


00:30:37.584 --> 00:30:39.334
(straining)


00:30:44.917 --> 00:30:47.417
(grunting)


00:30:52.959 --> 00:30:54.542
C'mon, just one floor!


00:30:54.917 --> 00:30:56.917
- (straining)
<i>- (woman speaking French on TV)</i>


00:30:58.459 --> 00:30:59.459
Benny!


00:31:00.084 --> 00:31:00.959
BENNY: Jesus!


00:31:01.292 --> 00:31:03.042
- Call an ambulance!
- I was with him.


00:31:03.209 --> 00:31:04.792
Leave it! Call an ambulance!


00:31:04.959 --> 00:31:06.376
What's wrong with him?


00:31:06.876 --> 00:31:08.376
He's feeling unwell again?


00:31:08.459 --> 00:31:10.459
(panting, straining)


00:31:19.251 --> 00:31:21.626
Did anyone see him like that?
The neighbours?


00:31:21.792 --> 00:31:24.459
No one saw. Let me handle it.


00:31:24.626 --> 00:31:26.001
Benny, I need you!


00:31:26.167 --> 00:31:28.459
It'll be all right.
It'll be all right.


00:31:29.584 --> 00:31:31.834
(breathing rhythmically)


00:31:36.959 --> 00:31:39.209
Stay with me.
(grunts)


00:31:39.292 --> 00:31:40.709
(breathing rhythmically)


00:31:42.751 --> 00:31:43.917
Mum, get out!


00:31:45.667 --> 00:31:46.917
Get out, Mum!


00:31:47.626 --> 00:31:48.626
Fuck…


00:31:49.792 --> 00:31:50.876
Fuck.


00:31:51.626 --> 00:31:52.626
Stop it!


00:31:53.626 --> 00:31:55.167
Stop, you're crazy!


00:32:02.042 --> 00:32:03.001
Stop!


00:32:03.876 --> 00:32:05.084
You're acting crazy!


00:32:06.584 --> 00:32:09.834
It's the Red Wind,
blocking his breathing.


00:32:10.334 --> 00:32:12.334
I see it in his veins.


00:32:12.501 --> 00:32:13.876
It's the Red Wind.


00:32:14.751 --> 00:32:17.417
It's blowing.
It blocks everything up.


00:32:17.709 --> 00:32:19.751
He must be cleansed
on the inside.


00:32:20.251 --> 00:32:21.667
What Red Wind?


00:32:23.251 --> 00:32:25.042
You'll drown him!


00:32:26.584 --> 00:32:27.626
Benny!


00:32:28.126 --> 00:32:30.667
Benny! Benny!


00:32:30.751 --> 00:32:32.126
Benny, come here!


00:32:33.042 --> 00:32:33.876
Get her out.


00:32:34.501 --> 00:32:35.334
Get her out.


00:32:41.584 --> 00:32:46.126
I took his gear this morning,
threw all his needles away.


00:32:46.501 --> 00:32:47.709
He must've…


00:32:48.792 --> 00:32:50.376
taken someone else's.


00:32:56.334 --> 00:32:57.167
Amin…


00:33:00.751 --> 00:33:01.751
Amin…


00:33:07.376 --> 00:33:09.876
(groaning)


00:33:09.959 --> 00:33:12.459
(Amin gasps)


00:33:14.584 --> 00:33:17.292
(coughing)


00:33:24.126 --> 00:33:25.876
(groans)


00:33:25.959 --> 00:33:29.584
(coughs)


00:33:29.667 --> 00:33:31.126
(groans)


00:33:34.834 --> 00:33:36.542
(door opens)


00:33:37.626 --> 00:33:39.626
(indistinct chatter in hallway)


00:33:56.251 --> 00:33:58.251
(companion breathing
through nose)


00:34:06.167 --> 00:34:07.501
(chair clacks loudly)


00:34:33.792 --> 00:34:35.501
(door opens)


00:34:35.584 --> 00:34:37.792
Hello. Come with me, please.


00:34:43.709 --> 00:34:45.376
(whispering):
Can we move, please?


00:34:54.126 --> 00:34:56.001
Excuse me, would you mind…


00:34:56.459 --> 00:34:59.751
Oh, go ahead.
I'm gonna die anyway!


00:35:16.167 --> 00:35:18.417
Stop. She's in my class.


00:35:21.126 --> 00:35:22.126
COMPANION: So?


00:35:25.334 --> 00:35:26.167
Is it my face?


00:35:26.334 --> 00:35:29.167
Or you think it's weird,
me kissing your teacher?


00:35:29.584 --> 00:35:30.917
Please stop.


00:35:33.376 --> 00:35:34.376
No, no.


00:35:36.292 --> 00:35:39.667
It's no worse than seeing
your parents kiss, I hope.


00:35:41.167 --> 00:35:42.209
Well…


00:35:43.042 --> 00:35:45.209
I've never seen
my parents kiss.


00:35:45.834 --> 00:35:47.126
How come?


00:35:47.292 --> 00:35:48.584
Must you?


00:35:51.876 --> 00:35:53.334
I only have one parent.


00:35:54.584 --> 00:35:56.292
- COMPANION: Which one?
- My mum.


00:35:56.834 --> 00:35:57.834
Good.


00:35:58.626 --> 00:35:59.834
Mums are best.


00:36:00.626 --> 00:36:01.459
Yeah?


00:36:01.959 --> 00:36:02.834
Yeah.


00:36:03.126 --> 00:36:04.917
Even with this face,


00:36:05.417 --> 00:36:08.084
my mum would've said
I look like a Greek statue.


00:36:08.417 --> 00:36:09.917
Beautiful as Apollo.


00:36:14.042 --> 00:36:15.209
Right, but…


00:36:16.126 --> 00:36:17.417
you are beautiful.


00:36:19.001 --> 00:36:20.042
It's true.


00:36:20.584 --> 00:36:23.292
(chuckling)


00:36:26.626 --> 00:36:29.376
(laughs)


00:36:37.001 --> 00:36:38.001
(door opens)


00:36:38.084 --> 00:36:39.667
NURSE:
Alpha, come with me.


00:36:43.834 --> 00:36:45.376
- Ready for your blood test?
- No.


00:36:55.917 --> 00:36:57.167
(whistle blows)


00:36:57.334 --> 00:36:59.251
- Got it!
- Got it!


00:36:59.417 --> 00:37:00.334
GYM TEACHER: Good.


00:37:00.417 --> 00:37:02.084
- (ball bounces)
- (students groan)


00:37:02.167 --> 00:37:03.376
Why didn't anyone go?


00:37:03.542 --> 00:37:04.834
Communicate, guys!


00:37:05.917 --> 00:37:06.917
(girl speaks French)


00:37:07.917 --> 00:37:10.334
- (ball bounces)
- GYM TEACHER: Again. Go!


00:37:11.459 --> 00:37:12.792
(girl speaks French)


00:37:12.876 --> 00:37:13.834
(Alpha gasps)


00:37:13.917 --> 00:37:15.042
(exclaims in French)


00:37:15.126 --> 00:37:16.292
You did that on purpose!


00:37:16.459 --> 00:37:17.917
Just part of the game!


00:37:18.084 --> 00:37:19.709
You keep targeting me!


00:37:19.876 --> 00:37:21.251
Stop, stop, stop!


00:37:21.376 --> 00:37:22.876
- (whistle blows)
- GIRL: Got it!


00:37:22.959 --> 00:37:24.626
(grunts, groans)


00:37:24.709 --> 00:37:26.167
- GYM TEACHER: Too bad. Keep going.
- GIRL: <i>Allez.</i>


00:37:28.376 --> 00:37:29.501
- Play ball!
- (grunts mockingly)


00:37:29.584 --> 00:37:30.459
(gym teacher speaking French)


00:37:30.542 --> 00:37:31.959
Get lost.


00:37:32.126 --> 00:37:33.542
It's a game. Serve.


00:37:33.709 --> 00:37:34.584
Shut up.


00:37:37.292 --> 00:37:39.584
(ball bouncing)


00:37:41.459 --> 00:37:42.376
Sir…


00:37:43.042 --> 00:37:45.751
- GYM TEACHER: What?
- There's blood on me that's not mine.


00:37:45.917 --> 00:37:46.959
GYM TEACHER:
Wipe it off.


00:37:47.042 --> 00:37:48.751
GIRL:
What if she gave it to me?


00:37:49.417 --> 00:37:52.251
- Gave you what?
- The thing, if it seeps into my skin!


00:37:53.542 --> 00:37:55.501
GYM TEACHER:
Go to the bathroom,


00:37:55.667 --> 00:37:56.959
rinse it off.


00:37:58.042 --> 00:37:58.876
Let's go.


00:38:00.626 --> 00:38:01.667
Use this one.


00:38:02.251 --> 00:38:04.501
Alpha, sit this match out.


00:38:05.209 --> 00:38:06.209
Take a break.


00:38:10.042 --> 00:38:12.626
(ball bouncing)


00:38:17.584 --> 00:38:19.167
(students speaking French)


00:38:27.292 --> 00:38:29.792
Does your girlfriend
know about us or what?


00:38:31.792 --> 00:38:32.917
Did you tell anyone?


00:38:33.084 --> 00:38:35.542
No. Who do you think I am?


00:38:38.667 --> 00:38:40.042
What'd your test say?


00:38:40.209 --> 00:38:41.042
For?


00:38:41.792 --> 00:38:43.876
Is your tattoo infected
by the thing?


00:38:44.126 --> 00:38:46.334
Seriously?
I just took the test.


00:38:47.542 --> 00:38:48.959
When will you know?


00:38:49.126 --> 00:38:52.167
Dunno, but it's just protocol,
no big deal.


00:38:52.251 --> 00:38:54.126
Okay. And…


00:38:54.626 --> 00:38:57.542
if it's protocol,
should I get tested too?


00:39:00.459 --> 00:39:01.709
What's your deal?


00:39:02.084 --> 00:39:03.459
We hooked up.


00:39:03.626 --> 00:39:06.167
If you're sick, I am too, okay?


00:39:06.834 --> 00:39:08.251
C'mon, you know me.


00:39:08.876 --> 00:39:10.126
Fuck that shit!


00:39:12.167 --> 00:39:14.584
Know you or not,
you can give it to me!


00:39:17.459 --> 00:39:18.792
Tell me the truth.


00:39:20.167 --> 00:39:21.126
Do you feel sick?


00:39:21.626 --> 00:39:24.167
I don't know, what the hell?
I don't know!


00:39:24.251 --> 00:39:26.667
- (clapping)
- (indistinct chatter)


00:39:29.626 --> 00:39:31.126
If you're sick
you gotta tell me.


00:39:31.292 --> 00:39:33.126
I didn't hide anything,
you were there!


00:39:33.251 --> 00:39:34.376
(shushes)


00:39:35.417 --> 00:39:36.792
What are you doing to me?


00:39:36.959 --> 00:39:39.251
Nothing!
We just kissed, we didn't fuck!


00:39:39.417 --> 00:39:40.876
Shit, I knew it!


00:39:42.084 --> 00:39:43.501
So you really are sick?


00:39:47.376 --> 00:39:49.167
GYM TEACHER:
Alpha, what are you doing?


00:39:54.667 --> 00:39:55.792
AMIN:
I'm burning up.


00:39:56.292 --> 00:39:57.834
It's too hot, crank the AC.


00:39:58.001 --> 00:40:00.209
No AC.
I'm not the Queen of England.


00:40:00.376 --> 00:40:01.251
Open your window.


00:40:01.417 --> 00:40:03.917
I know a guy
who'll install it cheap.


00:40:04.084 --> 00:40:05.084
Live a little!


00:40:06.751 --> 00:40:07.709
Hey, you!


00:40:08.334 --> 00:40:11.042
- Hot, isn't it?
- I don't know, I guess.


00:40:11.584 --> 00:40:12.417
See?


00:40:13.001 --> 00:40:14.459
<i>Even the kid's hot.</i>


00:40:15.209 --> 00:40:17.167
<i>Why did I have to come?</i>


00:40:17.584 --> 00:40:19.251
MUM:
<i>Prefer to stay locked inside?</i>


00:40:19.417 --> 00:40:22.042
AMIN: <i>They're the ones
who want me locked up.</i>


00:40:23.584 --> 00:40:24.501
Open up.


00:40:24.959 --> 00:40:26.001
Damn door!


00:40:26.334 --> 00:40:28.334
- Can't get it.
- It's unlocked!


00:40:29.709 --> 00:40:31.042
(Amin sighing)


00:40:42.292 --> 00:40:44.959
Why does it always stink
of death here?


00:40:45.126 --> 00:40:47.126
Hey, show some respect.


00:40:48.376 --> 00:40:51.626
(exhales)
Great. The welcome committee.


00:40:52.167 --> 00:40:54.334
Can't you do that inside?


00:40:54.501 --> 00:40:55.959
Mum is in there.


00:41:00.167 --> 00:41:01.251
Hey.


00:41:02.584 --> 00:41:03.751
Don't look at my brother.


00:41:04.584 --> 00:41:06.501
You have no business together.


00:41:08.126 --> 00:41:11.251
Your brother?
I'm not looking at anything.


00:41:12.459 --> 00:41:13.292
Yeah.


00:41:14.084 --> 00:41:15.209
Right.


00:41:15.292 --> 00:41:16.709
(sighs)


00:41:16.792 --> 00:41:17.834
Damn it.


00:41:19.001 --> 00:41:20.001
(groans)


00:41:20.084 --> 00:41:21.751
(panting)


00:41:21.834 --> 00:41:22.667
Amin,


00:41:23.334 --> 00:41:24.459
come on.


00:41:31.126 --> 00:41:33.251
Watch where you step, honey.


00:41:42.251 --> 00:41:44.834
("Allegretto" from Beethoven's
<i>The Tempest</i> playing)


00:41:44.917 --> 00:41:46.917
(overlapping chatter)


00:41:53.917 --> 00:41:56.292
Dessert?
We haven't even started!


00:41:56.376 --> 00:41:58.584
- (speaking French)
- (laughter)


00:41:59.584 --> 00:42:01.584
(overlapping chatter)


00:42:13.626 --> 00:42:16.209
♪♪


00:42:21.084 --> 00:42:22.709
(sniffles)


00:42:33.209 --> 00:42:37.084
(speaks foreign language)


00:42:39.834 --> 00:42:40.751
Mum…


00:42:41.084 --> 00:42:42.126
Mum!


00:42:43.709 --> 00:42:46.209
- What'd she say? Translate, please.
- Dunno.


00:42:46.376 --> 00:42:48.334
Probably something
about the food.


00:42:51.792 --> 00:42:53.667
Mum, I said
don't leave me alone.


00:42:53.834 --> 00:42:55.501
I don't get anything
Grandma says!


00:42:55.667 --> 00:42:59.126
I have a life too, Alph!
She asks if you want mutton.


00:42:59.292 --> 00:43:01.876
She only eats semolina
with milk and sugar.


00:43:02.042 --> 00:43:04.667
Even on Eid, no mutton?


00:43:05.167 --> 00:43:07.292
Careful,
her teeth will fall out.


00:43:07.459 --> 00:43:09.042
Yes, Mum, even on Eid.


00:43:09.209 --> 00:43:11.626
I've never seen anyone
lose their teeth


00:43:11.792 --> 00:43:13.584
for not eating mutton.


00:43:13.667 --> 00:43:15.709
(laughs)


00:43:22.292 --> 00:43:24.292
(speaking French)


00:43:26.917 --> 00:43:28.626
How old are you, seriously?


00:43:28.709 --> 00:43:31.001
(laughter)


00:43:31.084 --> 00:43:33.917
(overlapping chatter)


00:43:39.542 --> 00:43:41.792
Benny, you eat couscous
with a fork?


00:43:41.959 --> 00:43:43.792
Sure, to stab the chick peas.


00:43:43.959 --> 00:43:45.292
It's eaten with a spoon!


00:43:45.459 --> 00:43:46.876
I eat French style!


00:43:46.959 --> 00:43:48.626
- (laughter)
- We're in France.


00:43:48.751 --> 00:43:51.959
Couscous is not salad.
You eat it with a spoon.


00:43:52.209 --> 00:43:53.042
Sure.


00:43:53.584 --> 00:43:54.542
Got it?


00:43:54.792 --> 00:43:55.876
Sure, I got it.


00:43:55.959 --> 00:43:58.167
(laughter)


00:44:02.709 --> 00:44:04.709
(speaking French)


00:44:04.792 --> 00:44:06.542
(laughter)


00:44:10.667 --> 00:44:12.376
(speaking indistinctly)


00:44:16.334 --> 00:44:18.251
♪♪


00:44:20.417 --> 00:44:21.959
(Grandma speaks
foreign language)


00:44:22.042 --> 00:44:23.501
BENNY:
Was that aimed at me?


00:44:23.792 --> 00:44:25.042
I thought so.


00:44:25.209 --> 00:44:26.292
AUNT: Not at all!


00:44:29.084 --> 00:44:30.792
Got any ham in the fridge?


00:44:30.959 --> 00:44:33.084
You eat pork, bring your own.


00:44:33.251 --> 00:44:34.792
Your mutton smells like feet.


00:44:34.959 --> 00:44:38.084
- No way! I made it with love.
- Can't taste the love.


00:44:38.709 --> 00:44:42.042
Don't wanna assimilate,
just say so. Make an effort.


00:44:42.834 --> 00:44:44.667
Just asking for a bit of ham.


00:44:45.334 --> 00:44:47.334
Okay, you're making no effort.


00:44:47.459 --> 00:44:50.292
(sisters groan mockingly)


00:44:50.376 --> 00:44:51.251
I'm off to get ham!


00:44:51.376 --> 00:44:52.376
(laughter)


00:44:52.459 --> 00:44:54.001
Go on, go!


00:44:54.167 --> 00:44:57.459
<i>♪ Leave, and don't come back! ♪</i>


00:44:57.542 --> 00:45:00.376
<i>♪ Leave,
and don't come back! ♪</i>


00:45:00.459 --> 00:45:01.959
Come dance with me!


00:45:02.042 --> 00:45:05.459
(sisters vocalising)


00:45:05.542 --> 00:45:09.292
<i>♪ Go in peace,
I will not follow! ♪</i>


00:45:09.417 --> 00:45:11.334
- Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.


00:45:11.417 --> 00:45:14.167
(overlapping chatter)


00:45:14.251 --> 00:45:15.876
(laughter)


00:45:17.126 --> 00:45:18.876
So Benny's a big racist?


00:45:19.042 --> 00:45:20.459
Yeah, he's totally racist.


00:45:20.626 --> 00:45:21.751
I don't get it.


00:45:22.501 --> 00:45:24.584
We grew up together,
he's family.


00:45:25.209 --> 00:45:26.584
He was crying earlier.


00:45:31.292 --> 00:45:34.209
He lost his best friend,
never got over it.


00:45:34.292 --> 00:45:35.917
(speaks indistinctly)


00:45:44.751 --> 00:45:46.876
(laughter and chatter continue)


00:46:08.042 --> 00:46:09.876
- Where are you going?
- Be right back.


00:46:14.792 --> 00:46:16.126
No more, I'm full.


00:46:16.292 --> 00:46:18.834
Go on! Your grandma
doesn't like waste.


00:46:19.001 --> 00:46:21.376
Enough, you'll make her fat!


00:46:21.542 --> 00:46:23.709
So? Being fat isn't a disease!


00:46:23.876 --> 00:46:25.751
She eats because she's happy.


00:46:25.917 --> 00:46:26.834
Be happy, sweetie.


00:46:27.001 --> 00:46:27.959
Bullshit.


00:46:30.376 --> 00:46:31.709
You made her feel guilty!


00:46:31.876 --> 00:46:33.334
No, I just have to pee!


00:46:33.417 --> 00:46:34.417
Ah.


00:46:34.501 --> 00:46:36.751
(speaks foreign language)


00:46:36.834 --> 00:46:38.834
(door creaking)


00:46:40.376 --> 00:46:42.376
(chatter continues
in background)


00:46:43.376 --> 00:46:45.376
♪♪


00:46:58.084 --> 00:46:59.834
(sighs)


00:47:04.209 --> 00:47:05.334
(Amin gasps)


00:47:07.417 --> 00:47:09.251
MUM:
Not here, goddamn it!


00:47:09.334 --> 00:47:11.042
(screams)


00:47:13.126 --> 00:47:15.376
(shuddering)


00:47:21.834 --> 00:47:25.334
What's your mum doing?
She doesn't want to be with us?


00:47:25.459 --> 00:47:27.334
(stammers)
Mum's asleep.


00:47:29.751 --> 00:47:32.417
We mustn't wake her.
We can't go in.


00:47:53.501 --> 00:47:56.251
<i>(walking footfalls)</i>


00:47:56.334 --> 00:47:58.334
(anxious chatter)


00:48:02.292 --> 00:48:04.292
(overlapping shouting)


00:48:08.417 --> 00:48:09.709
Open the door.


00:48:10.876 --> 00:48:14.167
Back up, no point pushing.


00:48:14.334 --> 00:48:16.751
What the hell's going on,
who are you?


00:48:16.917 --> 00:48:20.042
The director says we're full,
so I told them.


00:48:20.209 --> 00:48:21.251
They don't want to know!


00:48:21.417 --> 00:48:22.834
He said to lock the door?


00:48:23.001 --> 00:48:25.209
And let no one in.
Just doing my job.


00:48:25.376 --> 00:48:26.501
We can't do this!


00:48:26.626 --> 00:48:28.626
(overlapping shouting)


00:48:31.459 --> 00:48:35.876
I'll try to find out what's
going on. I don't know either.


00:48:38.334 --> 00:48:39.667
Listen to me…


00:48:41.917 --> 00:48:44.209
I don't know what to do!


00:48:44.376 --> 00:48:45.459
I'm sorry.


00:48:45.584 --> 00:48:47.584
(overlapping chatter)


00:48:48.959 --> 00:48:52.334
I understand,
but, sir, don't do that.


00:48:52.501 --> 00:48:55.501
You won't get inside this way.
You must calm down.


00:48:56.917 --> 00:48:59.334
You must calm down first.


00:49:00.667 --> 00:49:02.209
Wait, wait…


00:49:02.292 --> 00:49:03.834
(man speaks French)


00:49:03.917 --> 00:49:05.959
<i>Oui. Attendez.</i>


00:49:06.042 --> 00:49:08.709
(overlapping shouting)


00:49:10.417 --> 00:49:12.709
Let me go, let me go!


00:49:15.834 --> 00:49:17.001
Wait.


00:49:17.126 --> 00:49:19.167
(overlapping chatter)


00:49:19.251 --> 00:49:21.209
I'm with my brother.
He's right here.


00:49:21.376 --> 00:49:22.792
Let him through!


00:49:23.251 --> 00:49:24.501
He's my brother.


00:49:25.542 --> 00:49:27.542
(overlapping shouting)


00:49:29.751 --> 00:49:31.542
Stand over there.
Stand over there.


00:49:31.626 --> 00:49:33.959
- Stand over there.
- SECURITY: Hey, whoa, whoa, whoa…


00:49:34.042 --> 00:49:35.959
Wait, wait, wait!


00:49:36.042 --> 00:49:38.959
I want to see patients only!
Patients only!


00:49:39.042 --> 00:49:40.709
- (woman yelling in French)
- Okay. You, come.


00:49:41.167 --> 00:49:42.292
You, come!


00:49:42.834 --> 00:49:45.292
Come, come. Go ahead.


00:49:46.167 --> 00:49:47.001
You too.


00:49:48.417 --> 00:49:49.626
These are my patients!


00:49:49.751 --> 00:49:51.501
(security guard
speaking French)


00:49:51.584 --> 00:49:54.167
- They're with me, they're my patients.
- (speaks French)


00:49:54.251 --> 00:49:56.834
Open the door.
Open the door, I said!


00:49:56.959 --> 00:49:58.959
(overlapping shouting)


00:49:59.042 --> 00:50:00.876
(speaks French)


00:50:01.876 --> 00:50:02.751
Go ahead.


00:50:04.501 --> 00:50:06.584
Let them in, patients only.


00:50:07.876 --> 00:50:09.126
You, come!


00:50:09.292 --> 00:50:10.459
Get in.


00:50:11.959 --> 00:50:13.501
Let them in, patients only.


00:50:18.542 --> 00:50:19.834
Stop, stop, stop, stop.


00:50:19.917 --> 00:50:21.376
That's it! That's it!


00:50:21.459 --> 00:50:22.959
That's it!
That's it!


00:50:35.584 --> 00:50:38.251
Nothing personal, we just
can't have you in the water.


00:50:38.417 --> 00:50:39.959
I won't go, let me out.


00:50:40.417 --> 00:50:41.417
You're contagious.


00:50:41.876 --> 00:50:44.542
Your bullshit is what's
contagious! I'm not sick!


00:50:44.626 --> 00:50:46.959
(screaming)


00:50:47.042 --> 00:50:48.001
Fuck!


00:50:48.084 --> 00:50:49.084
(panting)


00:50:52.167 --> 00:50:54.001
(screams)


00:50:54.084 --> 00:50:56.084
(indistinct chatter)


00:51:04.667 --> 00:51:05.667
(gasps)


00:51:13.501 --> 00:51:15.501
(panting)


00:51:18.959 --> 00:51:20.459
(grunting)


00:51:33.001 --> 00:51:34.167
(screams)


00:51:36.876 --> 00:51:37.876
(coughs)


00:51:44.917 --> 00:51:47.001
(panting)


00:52:00.251 --> 00:52:02.251
(panting continues)


00:52:17.626 --> 00:52:18.626
(exhales)


00:52:20.501 --> 00:52:23.334
(panting)


00:52:48.459 --> 00:52:51.292
(students screaming)


00:53:07.751 --> 00:53:11.709
(Amin shuddering, muttering)


00:53:26.792 --> 00:53:28.917
(whimpering)


00:53:31.334 --> 00:53:33.751
(panting)


00:53:46.167 --> 00:53:48.751
(groaning)


00:54:01.209 --> 00:54:03.251
(grunting)


00:54:03.334 --> 00:54:05.834
(panting)


00:54:20.459 --> 00:54:22.459
♪♪


00:54:50.167 --> 00:54:52.626
(breathing heavily)


00:55:04.501 --> 00:55:05.876
- I'm getting Mum.
- No, no.


00:55:12.459 --> 00:55:14.459
(breath quivering)


00:55:32.001 --> 00:55:34.709
(sobbing)


00:55:44.001 --> 00:55:46.001
(Alpha sobbing)


00:55:56.917 --> 00:55:59.126
(both sobbing)


00:56:18.376 --> 00:56:20.376
♪♪


00:56:50.042 --> 00:56:52.042
(sobbing)


00:57:18.959 --> 00:57:20.167
I didn't do anything.


00:57:20.584 --> 00:57:21.709
I know.


00:57:22.917 --> 00:57:24.459
Let him talk first.


00:57:35.959 --> 00:57:37.917
You didn't mention
your uncle, right?


00:57:38.084 --> 00:57:39.292
- What?
- (shushes)


00:57:42.084 --> 00:57:43.917
Does anyone know
Amin is with us?


00:57:44.334 --> 00:57:46.709
Why?
What difference does it make?


00:57:46.876 --> 00:57:48.751
Alpha, keep your voice down!


00:57:52.251 --> 00:57:53.459
Yes or no?


00:57:55.542 --> 00:57:56.792
I don't think so.


00:57:58.626 --> 00:58:00.292
Don't mention him to anyone.


00:58:00.667 --> 00:58:01.792
Promise?


00:58:02.626 --> 00:58:03.876
But why?


00:58:05.584 --> 00:58:08.334
The pool is totally
your teacher's fault.


00:58:08.501 --> 00:58:12.417
And bleeding a little after
a blood test is no big deal.


00:58:12.584 --> 00:58:15.792
Well, it's not a great time
to bleed!


00:58:15.959 --> 00:58:16.792
As you know!


00:58:16.917 --> 00:58:21.126
So, what did my daughter do
that was so bad she's expelled?


00:58:21.292 --> 00:58:23.042
Nothing, she's not expelled.


00:58:23.209 --> 00:58:24.834
Great, we can go!


00:58:25.126 --> 00:58:26.001
Madam…


00:58:26.542 --> 00:58:27.376
Doctor.


00:58:28.667 --> 00:58:30.917
Give me two seconds, please.


00:58:31.792 --> 00:58:33.376
Many parents have called,


00:58:33.542 --> 00:58:37.084
worried about their children's
physical and mental health.


00:58:37.667 --> 00:58:40.126
Students wake up at night
in tears,


00:58:40.209 --> 00:58:41.876
afraid they were infected.


00:58:42.042 --> 00:58:44.709
I'm so sorry for you,
it must be awful.


00:58:44.876 --> 00:58:47.959
Ever considered educating them,
or is that a stretch?


00:58:48.417 --> 00:58:49.542
But…


00:58:50.084 --> 00:58:51.584
I'm not qualified!


00:58:51.917 --> 00:58:54.334
We… know nothing.


00:58:54.751 --> 00:58:56.167
We know some things.


00:58:56.334 --> 00:59:00.751
Could you at least give me her
test results when you get them?


00:59:01.292 --> 00:59:03.292
I will not divulge them,
of course.


00:59:03.459 --> 00:59:05.334
This is a joke!


00:59:05.792 --> 00:59:07.126
They'll kill me if I stay.


00:59:07.292 --> 00:59:09.751
- (school bell ringing)
- You're fine, everyone's fine! Okay?


00:59:12.459 --> 00:59:14.459
(busy chatter nearby)


00:59:43.126 --> 00:59:44.959
- (students groaning)
- STUDENT: Oh, no!


00:59:48.459 --> 00:59:50.459
(busy chatter continues)


01:00:15.334 --> 01:00:17.334
(busy chatter continues)


01:00:37.876 --> 01:00:40.876
(girls conversing in French)


01:01:05.959 --> 01:01:07.417
(sobbing softly)


01:01:20.667 --> 01:01:22.876
NURSE:
She must've had a big scare.


01:01:25.334 --> 01:01:27.626
Our biggest lesson as kids
used to be


01:01:27.792 --> 01:01:29.959
you touch the oven,
you get burnt.


01:01:32.084 --> 01:01:34.376
Must be hell to be a kid today.


01:01:37.126 --> 01:01:39.501
When was her blood drawn again?


01:01:40.959 --> 01:01:43.001
September 27th.


01:01:43.084 --> 01:01:45.751
(siren wailing in distance)


01:01:47.251 --> 01:01:50.126
Only two weeks after
her contact with the needle.


01:01:51.751 --> 01:01:54.167
We tested urgently
at your request.


01:01:55.709 --> 01:01:57.584
But would the virus be
detectable


01:01:57.667 --> 01:01:59.501
after only two weeks?


01:01:59.667 --> 01:02:01.042
If it's there?


01:02:01.209 --> 01:02:02.292
That's the minimum,


01:02:02.459 --> 01:02:05.084
but yes, it should be
detectable after two weeks.


01:02:15.209 --> 01:02:16.667
We'll do another test.


01:02:22.209 --> 01:02:24.251
I don't think it's necessary.


01:02:24.584 --> 01:02:25.584
Truly.


01:02:28.417 --> 01:02:30.084
We'll do another test.


01:02:30.917 --> 01:02:33.001
(Alpha gagging)


01:02:40.751 --> 01:02:42.917
ALPHA:
Think you'll find something?


01:02:53.292 --> 01:02:54.792
Take off your T-shirt.


01:03:02.876 --> 01:03:04.667
(Alpha clears throat)


01:03:06.167 --> 01:03:08.792
(coughing)


01:03:19.084 --> 01:03:20.501
Do the cat.


01:03:22.626 --> 01:03:24.167
Meow, meow.


01:03:24.251 --> 01:03:26.251
(mutters in French)


01:03:27.792 --> 01:03:29.584
Not a real cat!


01:03:29.751 --> 01:03:31.709
Hunch your back. Good.


01:03:35.709 --> 01:03:37.584
- Inhale.
- (wheezes)


01:03:37.667 --> 01:03:39.501
Stop. Exhale.


01:03:39.626 --> 01:03:41.626
(coughs)


01:03:41.709 --> 01:03:43.042
Again.


01:03:43.209 --> 01:03:45.167
- Inhale.
- (inhales deeply)


01:03:45.251 --> 01:03:46.376
Stop.


01:03:47.667 --> 01:03:48.709
Exhale.


01:03:48.792 --> 01:03:50.667
(coughing)


01:03:50.751 --> 01:03:51.751
Again.


01:03:52.334 --> 01:03:53.542
Breathe.


01:03:54.042 --> 01:03:55.251
Keep breathing.


01:03:55.751 --> 01:03:57.667
I can't, I can't breathe.


01:03:58.084 --> 01:04:01.292
Yes, you can, or you wouldn't
be able to talk.


01:04:01.417 --> 01:04:04.417
- (mutters)
- (coughing)


01:04:04.501 --> 01:04:06.334
Alpha, breathe.


01:04:06.501 --> 01:04:07.334
Breathe.


01:04:07.501 --> 01:04:08.626
Mum, I'm scared!


01:04:09.459 --> 01:04:11.292
- No.
- (coughing)


01:04:11.376 --> 01:04:13.667
Lie on your back, honey.
It's the only way.


01:04:13.792 --> 01:04:15.167
- (mutters)
- (gasps)


01:04:19.292 --> 01:04:20.667
What, am I bleeding?


01:04:21.917 --> 01:04:23.334
No, it's just drool.


01:04:30.626 --> 01:04:32.459
I'm keeping you here
this afternoon.


01:04:35.459 --> 01:04:37.876
(door opens)


01:04:55.542 --> 01:04:57.542
♪♪


01:05:15.126 --> 01:05:16.167
Wake up.


01:05:16.334 --> 01:05:19.834
You have a daughter,
you have a brother…


01:05:20.417 --> 01:05:22.751
You have a daughter,
you have a brother… (winces)


01:05:38.917 --> 01:05:40.959
(Alpha groaning)


01:05:44.334 --> 01:05:45.792
(Amin groaning)


01:05:51.459 --> 01:05:53.834
(both groaning)


01:06:15.834 --> 01:06:17.834
(tossing and turning continue)


01:06:19.459 --> 01:06:22.417
(Amin groaning, panting)


01:06:26.126 --> 01:06:28.126
♪♪


01:06:57.001 --> 01:06:59.876
(Alpha gasps)


01:06:59.959 --> 01:07:02.459
- What are you doing?
- (shushes)


01:07:04.917 --> 01:07:05.834
Come.


01:07:18.959 --> 01:07:19.834
No!


01:07:20.001 --> 01:07:21.084
It's fine.


01:07:21.834 --> 01:07:23.167
It changes nothing.


01:07:24.417 --> 01:07:27.376
If something happens to you,
it happens to me.


01:07:36.709 --> 01:07:39.584
(shushes)


01:07:40.626 --> 01:07:43.042
♪♪


01:08:03.209 --> 01:08:05.209
♪♪


01:08:23.959 --> 01:08:27.334
- (Amin straining)
<i>- (man speaking French on TV)</i>


01:08:37.876 --> 01:08:38.792
AMIN: Holy shit!


01:08:38.876 --> 01:08:40.501
(panting)


01:08:40.584 --> 01:08:41.792
I've had it.


01:08:45.584 --> 01:08:47.667
Your room is too small.


01:08:48.084 --> 01:08:49.751
You've been in jail.


01:08:53.292 --> 01:08:54.917
(door opens nearby)


01:08:55.917 --> 01:08:56.751
And?


01:08:56.917 --> 01:08:57.917
- (door closes)
- You're pretty fancy


01:08:58.001 --> 01:09:00.792
- for a guy who shit in front of hulks.
- (walking footfalls)


01:09:02.501 --> 01:09:04.292
- "Amin, visitor!"
- (shushes)


01:09:06.001 --> 01:09:08.334
This is a doctor's office,
Mum has patients!


01:09:09.292 --> 01:09:10.126
So?


01:09:10.251 --> 01:09:11.917
So we don't exist.


01:09:14.459 --> 01:09:16.167
Shouldn't you be at school?


01:09:17.251 --> 01:09:18.834
Can't you see I'm sick?


01:09:19.709 --> 01:09:20.792
Oh, yeah?


01:09:22.167 --> 01:09:23.917
You don't look sick to me.


01:09:24.501 --> 01:09:25.751
Are you a doctor?


01:09:26.542 --> 01:09:27.584
I don't get it.


01:09:28.709 --> 01:09:30.084
You wanna be sick?


01:09:30.417 --> 01:09:31.917
Shut your face!


01:09:36.084 --> 01:09:38.834
This room is way too small
for your trash talk.


01:09:42.751 --> 01:09:43.917
Hmm?


01:09:46.292 --> 01:09:48.209
Why are you still here?


01:09:49.959 --> 01:09:52.042
Shouldn't you be clean by now?


01:09:53.584 --> 01:09:55.667
You don't look sick either.


01:09:56.251 --> 01:09:57.376
You're just a junkie.


01:09:58.001 --> 01:10:00.251
That's a life choice,
not an illness.


01:10:03.667 --> 01:10:06.751
An excuse because you're
too chicken to off yourself.


01:10:25.459 --> 01:10:26.626
You know…


01:10:28.876 --> 01:10:31.376
it's hardly a choice
to be here,


01:10:31.542 --> 01:10:32.834
with you.


01:10:35.542 --> 01:10:37.584
Not exactly my dream life.


01:10:40.334 --> 01:10:42.459
If I really had the choice,


01:10:43.501 --> 01:10:45.001
I'd have done anything…


01:10:45.376 --> 01:10:46.376
anything…


01:10:46.792 --> 01:10:48.501
to avoid being here


01:10:48.667 --> 01:10:49.876
with you


01:10:50.209 --> 01:10:52.376
listening to this bullshit.


01:10:52.459 --> 01:10:55.959
(breathing heavily)


01:10:56.959 --> 01:11:00.542
(coughing)


01:11:00.626 --> 01:11:01.626
(shakes liquid)


01:11:04.334 --> 01:11:06.876
I'll anaesthetise you
for the biopsy. Okay?


01:11:07.042 --> 01:11:08.959
- It won't hurt.
- (grunts)


01:11:10.542 --> 01:11:13.876
(wrapper crinkles)


01:11:13.959 --> 01:11:17.417
(clattering softly)


01:11:17.501 --> 01:11:19.209
Been out lately?


01:11:20.501 --> 01:11:23.001
Country air would do you good.


01:11:24.876 --> 01:11:26.792
Or even just a park.


01:11:27.834 --> 01:11:31.167
How can I go out when an
expired yogurt could kill me?


01:11:31.251 --> 01:11:33.292
(clattering)


01:11:33.376 --> 01:11:36.334
I feel like I've been
reincarnated as a gnat.


01:11:41.709 --> 01:11:43.126
Is the kid at Mum's?


01:11:43.542 --> 01:11:45.042
No, she's here.


01:11:45.667 --> 01:11:47.959
Doing her homework
with the nurses.


01:11:48.917 --> 01:11:49.876
Can I see her?


01:11:51.251 --> 01:11:53.001
(mutters)


01:11:53.084 --> 01:11:54.084
(chuckles)


01:11:54.167 --> 01:11:57.334
Shouldn't you gain
a few kilos first?


01:12:01.084 --> 01:12:02.251
(scoffs)


01:12:03.209 --> 01:12:04.917
Ha ha.


01:12:05.001 --> 01:12:06.626
Afraid I'll scare her?


01:12:06.792 --> 01:12:08.376
No, nothing scares her.


01:12:08.959 --> 01:12:10.751
My daughter's a pit bull.


01:12:11.667 --> 01:12:13.667
Right, dogs can smell death.


01:12:14.126 --> 01:12:17.084
I'll stop right now
if you keep talking like that.


01:12:22.292 --> 01:12:23.834
How old is she now?


01:12:24.626 --> 01:12:26.626
(crumbling)


01:12:27.792 --> 01:12:29.042
AMIN:
Hmm?


01:12:34.167 --> 01:12:35.542
Five years old.


01:12:38.501 --> 01:12:41.417
Must be weird, always
at the hospital at her age.


01:12:44.209 --> 01:12:47.459
Everyone loves her.
She's the resident mascot.


01:12:48.292 --> 01:12:49.459
Right.


01:12:51.626 --> 01:12:52.876
Hmm.


01:12:52.959 --> 01:12:54.001
Still,


01:12:55.209 --> 01:12:57.334
weird life for a kid.


01:12:59.542 --> 01:13:01.542
(scraping)


01:13:10.709 --> 01:13:12.417
- (loud crack)
- (both gasp)


01:13:12.501 --> 01:13:15.167
(Amin screams)


01:13:16.292 --> 01:13:17.917
(groans)


01:13:18.001 --> 01:13:18.876
What was that?


01:13:22.209 --> 01:13:23.751
- (gasps)
- Nothing.


01:13:23.876 --> 01:13:26.167
- What do you mean, nothing?
- Nothing! Nothing!


01:13:26.292 --> 01:13:28.084
(Amin groaning)


01:13:30.917 --> 01:13:33.584
(Mum panting)


01:13:33.667 --> 01:13:35.876
Stop, let me handle this.


01:13:37.959 --> 01:13:40.292
(Amin groaning)


01:13:47.792 --> 01:13:48.959
Forget it.


01:13:49.834 --> 01:13:51.084
I felt it.


01:13:51.167 --> 01:13:54.001
(whimpering)


01:13:54.084 --> 01:13:55.042
I felt it.


01:13:55.167 --> 01:13:57.167
(Amin panting)


01:13:59.001 --> 01:14:02.209
(footfalls approach)


01:14:02.292 --> 01:14:05.001
(door opens)


01:14:05.084 --> 01:14:06.751
MUM: It's a zoo in here.


01:14:08.126 --> 01:14:09.334
(wind blowing)


01:14:11.792 --> 01:14:14.751
I didn't know about not
disturbing the customers.


01:14:15.084 --> 01:14:17.876
Next time, book a five-star
rehab with a garden. Okay?


01:14:18.042 --> 01:14:19.542
Honey, here…


01:14:19.626 --> 01:14:20.792
(Alpha grunts)


01:14:20.876 --> 01:14:22.709
You need water,
you're dehydrated.


01:14:35.709 --> 01:14:37.126
Go on, a bit more.


01:14:42.959 --> 01:14:44.126
A bit more.


01:14:45.626 --> 01:14:47.292
(Alpha drinks)


01:14:49.292 --> 01:14:51.751
Drink, that's right. Good.


01:14:52.834 --> 01:14:55.084
(spits, coughs)


01:14:55.167 --> 01:14:56.126
You'll drown me!


01:15:02.876 --> 01:15:04.876
I know what you're doing.


01:15:07.417 --> 01:15:08.501
Meaning?


01:15:08.917 --> 01:15:11.626
Don't start speaking Berber,
I'm not five!


01:15:11.792 --> 01:15:14.251
You know very well what I mean.


01:15:16.167 --> 01:15:18.001
You're acting like Mum.


01:15:20.334 --> 01:15:22.001
Don't go there, Amin.


01:15:24.376 --> 01:15:26.959
You believe
in the Red Wind now?


01:15:28.292 --> 01:15:29.834
We don't discuss that.


01:15:30.001 --> 01:15:31.667
What? What'd he say?


01:15:32.251 --> 01:15:33.459
Seriously?


01:15:34.501 --> 01:15:35.542
At least…


01:15:36.459 --> 01:15:38.209
Mum has an excuse.


01:15:39.459 --> 01:15:41.876
She's from another time
and place.


01:15:42.376 --> 01:15:43.626
But you?


01:15:43.792 --> 01:15:45.292
You're bourgeois,


01:15:45.459 --> 01:15:46.834
an atheist,


01:15:47.751 --> 01:15:48.917
a doctor!


01:15:49.417 --> 01:15:50.292
What's your problem?


01:15:50.459 --> 01:15:51.917
She's my problem!


01:15:52.084 --> 01:15:53.626
She's fine
when you're not around.


01:15:53.792 --> 01:15:56.459
You always have to blame
someone else, don't you?


01:15:56.626 --> 01:15:58.959
I thought her test came back
negative.


01:16:00.959 --> 01:16:03.459
- Can't trust the results.
- (puts out cigarette)


01:16:03.626 --> 01:16:05.251
Too many variables.


01:16:05.959 --> 01:16:08.167
So you'll heal her with water?


01:16:09.917 --> 01:16:11.501
It doesn't cleanse.


01:16:12.667 --> 01:16:14.209
It exorcises nothing.


01:16:14.376 --> 01:16:16.834
It doesn't heal your Red Wind!


01:16:17.459 --> 01:16:21.542
It only made me wanna get
even more fucked up!


01:16:22.376 --> 01:16:24.501
To try to forget…


01:16:25.376 --> 01:16:26.834
that my family…


01:16:28.209 --> 01:16:30.834
that my family tried
to drown me!


01:16:37.667 --> 01:16:39.126
And as far as I know,


01:16:41.834 --> 01:16:43.501
I'm still very much possessed.


01:16:45.751 --> 01:16:48.209
See the Red Wind
blowing through my veins?


01:16:48.376 --> 01:16:50.209
What's the Red Wind?


01:16:52.501 --> 01:16:55.917
If you mention the demon
one more time


01:16:56.084 --> 01:16:58.209
in my apartment, I'll…


01:16:58.376 --> 01:16:59.876
What'll you do?


01:16:59.959 --> 01:17:01.042
Hmm?


01:17:02.167 --> 01:17:04.167
What? Kick me out?


01:17:08.417 --> 01:17:11.042
Don't bother,
I'll kick myself out.


01:17:11.542 --> 01:17:12.876
You stay here.


01:17:14.001 --> 01:17:15.251
Stay here!


01:17:22.834 --> 01:17:24.376
What's your plan?


01:17:24.542 --> 01:17:27.917
Lock me up in the kid's room
until she's 30?


01:17:28.084 --> 01:17:30.959
Since when have you cared
about your future? Huh?


01:17:31.417 --> 01:17:32.709
You have no plan.


01:17:32.876 --> 01:17:35.084
Don't push me, Amin.
Don't push me.


01:17:35.251 --> 01:17:36.251
Why don't you let him?


01:17:36.417 --> 01:17:37.917
Because I said so!


01:17:38.834 --> 01:17:40.501
Don't you start, Alpha.


01:17:40.917 --> 01:17:42.542
I've had it with you, too.


01:17:42.626 --> 01:17:44.542
Something's always wrong
with you.


01:17:44.709 --> 01:17:46.126
With both of you!


01:17:50.334 --> 01:17:51.417
Get out.


01:17:56.167 --> 01:17:57.376
Get out!


01:18:22.626 --> 01:18:25.126
(panting)


01:18:27.251 --> 01:18:28.584
(rumbling)


01:18:29.501 --> 01:18:30.667
(gasps)


01:18:58.501 --> 01:19:00.251
(gasps)


01:19:03.001 --> 01:19:05.001
(shuddering)


01:19:12.751 --> 01:19:15.334
(groaning)


01:19:15.417 --> 01:19:18.251
(crying)


01:19:20.251 --> 01:19:23.209
(yelling)


01:19:24.792 --> 01:19:26.792
(hyperventilating)


01:19:36.709 --> 01:19:39.501
♪♪


01:19:39.584 --> 01:19:41.876
(screaming)


01:19:44.042 --> 01:19:46.042
(panting)


01:20:09.251 --> 01:20:10.917
Come on, come!


01:20:26.001 --> 01:20:28.001
("The Mercy Seat"
by Nick Cave playing)


01:20:34.542 --> 01:20:37.667
<i>♪ I began to warm and chill ♪</i>


01:20:37.751 --> 01:20:40.751
<i>♪ To objects and their fields ♪</i>


01:20:40.834 --> 01:20:43.917
<i>♪ Ragged cup
and a twisted mop ♪</i>


01:20:44.001 --> 01:20:46.917
<i>♪ The face of Jesus
in my soup ♪</i>


01:20:47.001 --> 01:20:50.417
<i>♪ Those sinister dinner deals ♪</i>


01:20:50.501 --> 01:20:53.542
<i>♪ The meal trolley's
wicked wheels ♪</i>


01:20:53.626 --> 01:20:57.001
<i>♪ A hooked bone rising
from my food ♪</i>


01:20:57.084 --> 01:20:59.667
<i>♪ All things good or ungood ♪</i>


01:20:59.751 --> 01:21:03.001
<i>♪ And the mercy seat
is awaiting ♪</i>


01:21:03.084 --> 01:21:06.084
<i>♪ And I think
my head is burning ♪</i>


01:21:06.167 --> 01:21:08.501
<i>♪ In a way I'm yearning ♪</i>


01:21:08.584 --> 01:21:12.501
<i>♪ To be done with all this
weighing of the truth ♪</i>


01:21:12.584 --> 01:21:15.167
<i>♪ An eye for an eye
and a tooth for a tooth ♪</i>


01:21:15.251 --> 01:21:18.876
<i>♪ And anyway,
I told the truth ♪</i>


01:21:18.959 --> 01:21:22.251
<i>♪ And I'm not afraid to die ♪</i>


01:21:34.417 --> 01:21:37.209
- (raucous chatter)
<i>- ♪ Interpret sign and catalogue ♪</i>


01:21:37.292 --> 01:21:40.542
<i>♪ A blackened tooth,
a scarlet fog ♪</i>


01:21:40.626 --> 01:21:43.459
<i>♪ The walls are bad,
black bottom kind ♪</i>


01:21:43.542 --> 01:21:46.251
<i>♪ They are
the sick breath at my hind ♪</i>


01:21:46.334 --> 01:21:49.667
<i>♪ They are the sick breath
at my hind ♪</i>


01:21:49.751 --> 01:21:52.542
- (slow thumping)
<i>- ♪ They are the sick breath at my hind ♪</i>


01:21:52.626 --> 01:21:54.667
<i>♪ They are the sick breath
gathering ♪</i>


01:21:54.751 --> 01:21:58.417
<i>♪ At my hind ♪</i>


01:21:58.501 --> 01:22:01.292
<i>♪ Well, I hear stories
from the chamber ♪</i>


01:22:01.376 --> 01:22:04.334
<i>♪ How Christ was born
into a manger ♪</i>


01:22:04.417 --> 01:22:07.209
- (thumping continues)
<i>- ♪ And like some ragged stranger ♪</i>


01:22:07.292 --> 01:22:08.917
<i>♪ Died upon the cross ♪</i>


01:22:09.001 --> 01:22:13.167
<i>♪ And might I say it seems
so fitting in its way ♪</i>


01:22:13.251 --> 01:22:16.667
<i>♪ He was a carpenter by trade ♪</i>


01:22:16.751 --> 01:22:20.126
<i>- ♪ Or at least that's what I'm told ♪</i>
- MAN: Alpha!


01:22:21.792 --> 01:22:23.459
(Alpha chuckles)


01:22:23.542 --> 01:22:25.126
(crowd whistling, cheering)


01:22:25.209 --> 01:22:30.167
<i>♪ My good hand tattooed "evil"
across his brother's fist ♪</i>


01:22:30.251 --> 01:22:31.167
(crowd chanting indistinctly)


01:22:31.251 --> 01:22:33.417
<i>♪ That filthy five,
they did nothing ♪</i>


01:22:33.501 --> 01:22:36.501
<i>♪ To challenge or resist ♪</i>


01:22:36.584 --> 01:22:39.626
<i>♪ In heaven
his throne is made of gold ♪</i>


01:22:39.709 --> 01:22:43.167
- (grunting)
<i>- ♪ And the ark of his testament is stowed ♪</i>


01:22:43.251 --> 01:22:47.584
<i>♪ A throne from which I'm told
all history does unfold ♪</i>


01:22:47.667 --> 01:22:49.751
<i>♪ Down here it's made
of wood and wire ♪</i>


01:22:49.834 --> 01:22:50.834
(gasps)


01:22:50.917 --> 01:22:54.501
<i>♪ And my body is on fire ♪</i>


01:22:54.584 --> 01:22:56.709
<i>♪ And God is never far away ♪</i>


01:22:56.792 --> 01:22:57.709
(grunts)


01:22:57.792 --> 01:23:00.126
<i>♪ Into the mercy seat I climb ♪</i>


01:23:00.209 --> 01:23:01.751
<i>♪ My head is shaved ♪</i>


01:23:01.834 --> 01:23:03.501
- (distorted voices overlap)
<i>- ♪ My head is wired ♪</i>


01:23:03.584 --> 01:23:05.376
<i>- ♪ Like a moth that tries ♪</i>
- Amin!


01:23:05.459 --> 01:23:07.709
<i>♪ To enter the bright eye ♪</i>


01:23:07.792 --> 01:23:10.834
<i>♪ So I go shuffling
out of life ♪</i>


01:23:10.917 --> 01:23:14.751
<i>♪ Just to hide
in death awhile ♪</i>


01:23:14.834 --> 01:23:17.417
<i>- ♪ And anyway, I never lied ♪</i>
- (straining)


01:23:17.501 --> 01:23:20.626
<i>♪ My kill-hand is called evil ♪</i>


01:23:20.709 --> 01:23:23.042
<i>♪ Wears a wedding band
that's good ♪</i>


01:23:23.126 --> 01:23:26.334
- (groaning)
<i>- ♪ 'Tis a long-suffering shackle ♪</i>


01:23:26.417 --> 01:23:29.251
<i>♪ Collaring all that rebel blood ♪</i>


01:23:29.334 --> 01:23:31.834
<i>♪ And the mercy seat
is awaiting ♪</i>


01:23:31.917 --> 01:23:35.001
<i>♪ And I think
my head is burning ♪</i>


01:23:35.084 --> 01:23:37.126
<i>♪ In a way I'm yearning ♪</i>


01:23:37.209 --> 01:23:40.792
<i>♪ To be done with all this
weighing of the truth ♪</i>


01:23:40.876 --> 01:23:43.584
<i>♪ An eye for an eye
and a tooth for a tooth ♪</i>


01:23:43.667 --> 01:23:46.709
<i>♪ And anyway,
I told the truth ♪</i>


01:23:46.792 --> 01:23:49.126
<i>♪ And I'm not afraid to die ♪</i>


01:23:49.209 --> 01:23:51.751
<i>♪ And the mercy seat
is awaiting ♪</i>


01:23:51.834 --> 01:23:54.626
<i>- ♪ And I think my head is smoking ♪</i>
- (laughter)


01:23:54.709 --> 01:23:56.542
<i>♪ In a way I'm hoping ♪</i>


01:23:56.626 --> 01:24:00.292
<i>♪ To be done with
all these looks of disbelief ♪</i>


01:24:00.376 --> 01:24:03.167
<i>♪ An eye for an eye
and a tooth for a tooth ♪</i>


01:24:03.251 --> 01:24:05.917
<i>♪ And anyway,
I told the truth ♪</i>


01:24:06.001 --> 01:24:08.334
<i>♪ And I'm not afraid to die ♪</i>


01:24:08.417 --> 01:24:11.167
- (laughter)
<i>- ♪ And the mercy seat is awaiting ♪</i>


01:24:11.251 --> 01:24:13.959
<i>♪ And I think
my head is boiling ♪</i>


01:24:14.042 --> 01:24:16.834
<i>♪ In a way that's spoiling
all the fun ♪</i>


01:24:16.917 --> 01:24:19.667
<i>♪ By all this consequence
and truth ♪</i>


01:24:19.751 --> 01:24:20.959
- (distorted voices overlap)
<i>- ♪ An eye for an eye ♪</i>


01:24:21.042 --> 01:24:22.417
<i>♪ And a truth for a truth ♪</i>


01:24:22.501 --> 01:24:25.626
<i>♪ And anyway,
I spoke the truth ♪</i>


01:24:25.709 --> 01:24:29.126
<i>♪ And I'm afraid
I told a lie. ♪</i>


01:24:40.501 --> 01:24:42.501
(music playing inside)


01:24:51.751 --> 01:24:54.084
(raucous shouting inside)


01:24:55.792 --> 01:24:58.084
Where were you? Come on.


01:24:58.584 --> 01:25:00.167
C'mon, I need to walk.


01:25:03.542 --> 01:25:06.042
- Where are we going?
- I need two seconds.


01:25:07.459 --> 01:25:10.376
(wind whistling)


01:25:16.001 --> 01:25:17.834
ALPHA:
Amin, let's take off!


01:25:26.459 --> 01:25:28.667
Where are we?
You're scaring me!


01:25:28.834 --> 01:25:30.376
Answer me!


01:25:31.251 --> 01:25:32.209
Let go!


01:25:32.376 --> 01:25:33.917
I'm not your father!


01:25:34.292 --> 01:25:35.667
What do you want?


01:25:44.376 --> 01:25:46.376
♪♪


01:26:14.751 --> 01:26:16.667
ADRIEN:
Feels weird to see you here.


01:26:17.167 --> 01:26:19.126
I've come thousands of times.


01:26:20.001 --> 01:26:21.626
This is different.


01:26:24.167 --> 01:26:25.917
I was freaking out, Alph.


01:26:27.376 --> 01:26:28.751
I swear, I…


01:26:30.542 --> 01:26:33.042
I almost cried,
waiting for my results.


01:26:33.876 --> 01:26:35.834
I thought it was over for me.


01:26:38.001 --> 01:26:40.084
I was wondering
how to tell my mum.


01:26:40.792 --> 01:26:44.084
That arsehole doctor
was giving me a lecture.


01:26:44.251 --> 01:26:46.709
I was like,
"Dude, I'm a fucking virgin!"


01:26:47.459 --> 01:26:48.334
Are you?


01:26:48.501 --> 01:26:49.792
No, I'm negative.


01:26:50.751 --> 01:26:51.959
A virgin, I mean.


01:26:52.084 --> 01:26:53.584
Uh…


01:26:54.751 --> 01:26:55.626
Of course.


01:26:55.751 --> 01:26:56.917
(scoffs)


01:27:09.626 --> 01:27:11.251
(moans softly)


01:27:17.334 --> 01:27:19.334
♪♪


01:27:32.667 --> 01:27:34.667
♪♪


01:27:55.334 --> 01:27:57.334
♪♪


01:28:19.167 --> 01:28:21.167
♪♪


01:28:27.792 --> 01:28:29.501
- What's that?
- What?


01:28:34.584 --> 01:28:35.459
It's nothing.


01:28:36.001 --> 01:28:37.626
Can you turn off the light?


01:28:38.001 --> 01:28:39.751
Did you do that for me?


01:28:39.917 --> 01:28:40.792
What?


01:28:40.959 --> 01:28:44.042
No, it's A for Adrien.
Don't be silly.


01:28:44.376 --> 01:28:46.042
When did you get it?


01:28:48.167 --> 01:28:49.001
Right after you.


01:28:49.126 --> 01:28:50.417
Same day?


01:28:51.501 --> 01:28:53.084
Why didn't you tell me?


01:28:55.292 --> 01:28:56.584
Why didn't you tell me?


01:28:59.917 --> 01:29:01.459
What can I say?


01:29:02.334 --> 01:29:04.126
We shared a needle, Alph.


01:29:05.876 --> 01:29:08.209
Everyone thought
you'd caught it.


01:29:08.626 --> 01:29:11.542
I didn't want them to see me
as they saw you.


01:29:11.959 --> 01:29:14.001
Treat me as they treated you.


01:29:14.167 --> 01:29:17.459
You went off on me like I was
to blame if you died!


01:29:18.417 --> 01:29:19.542
I'm sorry.


01:29:35.751 --> 01:29:38.542
♪♪


01:29:38.626 --> 01:29:41.292
(wind whistling)


01:30:11.209 --> 01:30:14.334
(door opens)


01:30:14.417 --> 01:30:15.542
(walking footfalls)


01:30:15.626 --> 01:30:18.834
- (indistinct chatter in distance)
- (groans)


01:30:23.626 --> 01:30:26.209
- Good evening. May I?
- Of course.


01:30:41.917 --> 01:30:43.917
(receptionist typing)


01:30:58.459 --> 01:30:59.751
Hey, Mum.


01:31:00.084 --> 01:31:02.126
Sorry for waking you.


01:31:04.626 --> 01:31:07.084
Are Alpha and Amin with you?


01:31:10.167 --> 01:31:12.417
I called my place,
but no answer.


01:31:13.167 --> 01:31:16.417
I'm on the night shift.
He's watching Alpha.


01:31:20.084 --> 01:31:22.501
He's doing better now, Mum.


01:31:24.251 --> 01:31:26.001
Yes, I trust him.


01:31:30.167 --> 01:31:33.751
Let's not get into this now.
Good night.


01:31:33.917 --> 01:31:35.376
Bye, Mum.


01:31:42.042 --> 01:31:44.042
(shuddering)


01:32:00.626 --> 01:32:02.001
What are you doing here?


01:32:02.167 --> 01:32:03.584
AMIN:
What are <i>you</i> doing here?


01:32:09.417 --> 01:32:10.709
You going home?


01:32:11.792 --> 01:32:13.876
I don't even know
where this bus goes.


01:32:26.334 --> 01:32:28.334
Think it's possible
I'm not sick?


01:32:28.501 --> 01:32:30.042
I know you're not sick.


01:32:30.209 --> 01:32:31.167
How?


01:32:31.334 --> 01:32:32.542
Just look at you.


01:32:35.417 --> 01:32:37.209
When you have it, you know.


01:32:38.792 --> 01:32:39.959
(sniffles)


01:32:42.709 --> 01:32:44.626
Why is Mum so sure I'm sick?


01:32:45.042 --> 01:32:47.042
I thought
she was a good doctor.


01:32:47.209 --> 01:32:48.376
Of course she's a good doctor.


01:32:48.459 --> 01:32:51.167
And a good sister and mum,
that's why.


01:32:53.626 --> 01:32:55.167
Too much love, sometimes…


01:32:55.334 --> 01:32:56.959
makes people crazy.


01:33:15.876 --> 01:33:17.959
Think you could do me a favour?


01:33:19.834 --> 01:33:22.042
While you still like me
a little.


01:33:27.959 --> 01:33:30.209
I need to take some stuff…


01:33:30.626 --> 01:33:32.292
to come down, you know?


01:33:34.042 --> 01:33:35.417
If I fall asleep,


01:33:37.167 --> 01:33:38.626
don't wake me up.


01:33:41.501 --> 01:33:43.459
I mean it, for real.


01:33:44.501 --> 01:33:45.917
Whatever happens,


01:33:46.751 --> 01:33:48.251
don't wake me up.


01:33:51.751 --> 01:33:52.584
Can you do that?


01:33:52.959 --> 01:33:55.084
Dunno, what am I supposed
to do then?


01:33:58.459 --> 01:33:59.876
I'm begging you.


01:34:11.834 --> 01:34:14.501
("Let It Happen"
by Tame Impala playing)


01:34:26.709 --> 01:34:28.459
Wait here, be right back.


01:34:28.917 --> 01:34:30.376
Stay put.


01:34:37.751 --> 01:34:42.709
<i>♪ It's always around me,
all this noise ♪</i>


01:34:42.792 --> 01:34:48.292
<i>♪ But not nearly
as loud as the voice ♪</i>


01:34:48.376 --> 01:34:53.042
<i>♪ Saying "Let it happen,
let it happen ♪</i>


01:34:53.126 --> 01:34:54.792
<i>♪ "It's gonna feel so good ♪</i>


01:34:54.876 --> 01:35:00.292
<i>♪ Just let it happen,
let it happen." ♪</i>


01:35:01.667 --> 01:35:03.667
(waves crashing)


01:35:15.584 --> 01:35:17.584
(wind whistling)


01:35:25.459 --> 01:35:27.876
(big wave crashes)


01:35:27.959 --> 01:35:29.959
(gasps)


01:35:56.251 --> 01:35:58.251
(wind continues whistling)


01:36:21.001 --> 01:36:23.001
("Let It Happen"
by Tame Impala resumes)


01:36:40.001 --> 01:36:42.251
♪♪


01:36:56.667 --> 01:36:57.626
Fuck!


01:37:26.917 --> 01:37:29.501
(speaking indistinctly)


01:37:34.751 --> 01:37:35.834
(flicks lighter)


01:37:35.917 --> 01:37:38.376
You're out
of your fucking mind!


01:37:39.084 --> 01:37:43.084
It didn't work.
Must've been cut with caffeine.


01:37:43.251 --> 01:37:45.042
I trusted you with my daughter!


01:37:45.167 --> 01:37:47.834
- (Amin yells)
- You goddamn selfish arsehole!


01:37:47.917 --> 01:37:49.376
(screams)


01:37:49.459 --> 01:37:50.667
Stop it!


01:37:50.751 --> 01:37:52.376
- (panting)
- Stop it!


01:37:52.501 --> 01:37:54.667
(crying)


01:37:54.959 --> 01:37:56.709
It's okay, it's okay…


01:37:56.792 --> 01:37:57.917
it's okay, it's okay.


01:37:58.001 --> 01:37:59.001
Shh. Mummy's here…


01:37:59.084 --> 01:38:01.542
Mummy's here. Mummy's here.


01:38:01.626 --> 01:38:03.792
(shushes)


01:38:03.876 --> 01:38:05.251
I'm here. I'm here.


01:38:05.417 --> 01:38:07.751
- (Alpha wailing)
- Nothing will happen to you. I'm here.


01:38:08.876 --> 01:38:09.959
Don't worry.


01:38:10.126 --> 01:38:11.751
Listen to me.


01:38:11.917 --> 01:38:14.167
You'll hide in here, okay?
Okay?


01:38:14.251 --> 01:38:18.459
You'll hide in here, like when
Santa comes, bringing gifts.


01:38:18.626 --> 01:38:20.376
Santa is coming?


01:38:21.042 --> 01:38:22.792
But it's not Christmas.


01:38:22.959 --> 01:38:24.792
Right, but…


01:38:25.792 --> 01:38:27.917
didn't we tell you that Santa


01:38:28.084 --> 01:38:31.167
makes extra rounds
for the nicest children?


01:38:31.334 --> 01:38:33.334
And who's the nicest?


01:38:33.626 --> 01:38:34.917
- Who?
- Me.


01:38:35.084 --> 01:38:36.417
Yes, you.


01:38:36.501 --> 01:38:37.667
(crying)


01:38:42.209 --> 01:38:43.626
No cheating.


01:38:44.042 --> 01:38:45.501
No cheating, okay?


01:38:45.667 --> 01:38:47.876
- Do you promise?
- I promise.


01:38:56.042 --> 01:38:58.501
(door opens)


01:39:19.209 --> 01:39:20.376
(Amin sniffles)


01:39:29.251 --> 01:39:30.584
You're not my brother.


01:39:31.251 --> 01:39:33.667
Yeah? Then what am I?


01:39:36.584 --> 01:39:39.292
Your needle is dirty.
Got another one?


01:39:41.084 --> 01:39:43.792
Why the hell do you care,
if I'm a stranger?


01:39:44.959 --> 01:39:46.709
I'm speaking as a doctor.


01:39:48.042 --> 01:39:49.334
(scoffs)


01:39:49.417 --> 01:39:50.959
What else can I catch?


01:39:52.667 --> 01:39:54.417
I already caught
the biggest fish.


01:40:03.459 --> 01:40:05.084
You risk a secondary infection.


01:40:05.251 --> 01:40:06.917
Secondary means after.


01:40:10.126 --> 01:40:11.834
There's no after with this.


01:40:14.709 --> 01:40:17.542
How did Alpha fit
into your plan?


01:40:17.626 --> 01:40:18.834
Huh?


01:40:20.376 --> 01:40:21.959
Was she gonna be here…


01:40:22.251 --> 01:40:23.959
alone with your corpse?


01:40:26.459 --> 01:40:27.751
No answer?


01:40:28.459 --> 01:40:30.542
- You have no answer.
- I have no choice.


01:40:45.751 --> 01:40:47.042
Dunno, if…


01:40:49.334 --> 01:40:51.876
if you like,
I could come live with you.


01:40:53.251 --> 01:40:55.501
If you insist
on keeping me alive.


01:40:56.209 --> 01:40:58.001
It won't save me, but…


01:40:58.167 --> 01:41:00.459
we three would have fun
watching TV,


01:41:00.542 --> 01:41:02.084
eating ice cream.
(chuckles)


01:41:13.376 --> 01:41:16.501
I don't wanna end up at
the hospital with the others.


01:41:20.876 --> 01:41:22.417
I can't, Amin.


01:41:25.751 --> 01:41:26.959
I can't.


01:41:29.209 --> 01:41:30.792
Not after tonight.


01:41:32.542 --> 01:41:34.001
Not with Alpha.


01:41:36.376 --> 01:41:37.834
She's too young.


01:41:38.334 --> 01:41:40.001
We can't mix her up in this.


01:41:42.917 --> 01:41:44.792
You know
what they'll all think.


01:41:47.834 --> 01:41:49.084
It means…


01:41:49.501 --> 01:41:51.042
no birthday parties,


01:41:51.417 --> 01:41:53.667
no sleepovers, no friends.


01:41:55.501 --> 01:41:57.167
I can't do that to her.


01:41:58.459 --> 01:41:59.292
Not even for you.


01:42:06.292 --> 01:42:08.542
I want us to be
an average family.


01:42:08.709 --> 01:42:10.917
The boring, reassuring kind.


01:42:11.334 --> 01:42:12.917
Until things calm down.


01:42:17.209 --> 01:42:19.667
I hope it's not too late
for her to forget.


01:42:20.792 --> 01:42:21.876
Forget what?


01:42:23.042 --> 01:42:23.876
Me?


01:42:25.459 --> 01:42:26.626
Everything.


01:42:26.792 --> 01:42:28.126
You, too.


01:42:37.959 --> 01:42:39.084
Stop…


01:42:39.251 --> 01:42:41.501
(Amin grunting)


01:42:54.459 --> 01:42:55.292
Fuck.


01:42:59.042 --> 01:43:01.626
Right, leave it. Leave it.


01:43:14.501 --> 01:43:16.084
(exhaling deeply)


01:43:35.084 --> 01:43:36.167
(Amin mutters)


01:43:44.876 --> 01:43:46.376
(vials clatter)


01:43:50.001 --> 01:43:51.459
(grunts)


01:43:54.251 --> 01:43:56.251
♪♪


01:44:10.542 --> 01:44:12.542
♪♪


01:44:29.459 --> 01:44:31.459
(breathing heavily)


01:44:47.792 --> 01:44:50.292
(wind whistling)


01:45:07.751 --> 01:45:09.751
♪♪


01:45:31.792 --> 01:45:33.792
♪♪


01:46:01.834 --> 01:46:03.834
♪♪


01:46:17.751 --> 01:46:19.834
Wanna know a secret?


01:46:45.001 --> 01:46:46.542
I caught something.


01:47:06.334 --> 01:47:08.334
♪♪


01:47:16.959 --> 01:47:18.459
(gasps)


01:47:18.542 --> 01:47:19.376
Amin!


01:47:19.459 --> 01:47:21.709
Amin. Amin.


01:47:21.792 --> 01:47:23.292
No, no, no, no! No, no.


01:47:23.376 --> 01:47:24.709
Amin, Amin, wake up!


01:47:24.876 --> 01:47:26.959
- No, Mum, he doesn't want to!
- Wake up!


01:47:27.126 --> 01:47:28.167
Let go!


01:47:28.334 --> 01:47:29.917
- Wake up!
- No, Mum!


01:47:30.084 --> 01:47:31.834
- Let him sleep!
- Let go, I said!


01:47:32.001 --> 01:47:34.001
- Wake up! Amin. Amin, wake up.
- Please don't…


01:47:34.126 --> 01:47:35.334
Amin.


01:47:35.417 --> 01:47:37.334
(panting)


01:47:41.709 --> 01:47:43.876
Stay with me! Stay with me!


01:47:43.959 --> 01:47:44.959
(breathing rhythmically)


01:47:45.042 --> 01:47:47.542
(Alpha crying)


01:47:47.626 --> 01:47:49.417
- (whimpers)
- Get off!


01:47:51.542 --> 01:47:52.501
I promised him.


01:47:53.126 --> 01:47:56.084
I won't give up on you.
I won't give up on you.


01:47:56.167 --> 01:47:57.709
(Mum breathing rhythmically)


01:47:57.792 --> 01:47:59.792
(younger Alpha crying)


01:48:06.792 --> 01:48:07.667
Get my bag.


01:48:09.001 --> 01:48:10.334
Get my bag.


01:48:11.001 --> 01:48:11.834
Give it to me!


01:48:13.376 --> 01:48:14.626
- Give it to me.
- (protests)


01:48:14.709 --> 01:48:16.334
Give it to me. Give it to me!


01:48:16.417 --> 01:48:17.542
Let go!


01:48:17.959 --> 01:48:18.959
Let go!


01:48:20.917 --> 01:48:23.042
(younger Alpha crying)


01:48:25.876 --> 01:48:27.001
Don't do it!
(groans)


01:48:27.084 --> 01:48:28.876
(Amin gasps)


01:48:29.959 --> 01:48:32.292
(panting)


01:48:33.292 --> 01:48:35.292
(crying)


01:48:38.084 --> 01:48:39.876
(Amin coughs)


01:48:39.959 --> 01:48:42.126
(panting)


01:48:50.334 --> 01:48:52.834
(Mum panting)


01:49:02.834 --> 01:49:04.542
What are you doing?


01:49:07.459 --> 01:49:09.126
We said goodbye already.


01:49:11.959 --> 01:49:12.959
No.


01:49:14.292 --> 01:49:15.292
No.


01:49:17.751 --> 01:49:18.751
No.


01:49:21.376 --> 01:49:23.876
(both panting)


01:49:40.376 --> 01:49:41.959
I'm sorry.


01:49:58.959 --> 01:50:01.209
(patients coughing)


01:50:01.292 --> 01:50:03.292
(monitors beeping steadily)


01:50:11.251 --> 01:50:12.292
May I?


01:50:13.751 --> 01:50:14.834
Yes, of course.


01:50:15.334 --> 01:50:16.334
Mask and gloves?


01:50:16.751 --> 01:50:17.834
No, I'm good.


01:50:30.042 --> 01:50:31.042
So…


01:50:31.667 --> 01:50:33.209
Handsome as ever, my bro.


01:50:33.334 --> 01:50:34.334
(laughs weakly)


01:50:34.417 --> 01:50:36.709
(coughing)


01:50:42.001 --> 01:50:43.334
Come here.


01:50:44.667 --> 01:50:45.709
Come here.


01:50:49.126 --> 01:50:51.126
(Mum sighs)


01:50:59.667 --> 01:51:03.792
By handsome, I just mean
you didn't shit yourself today.


01:51:03.876 --> 01:51:05.876
(both laughing)


01:51:22.792 --> 01:51:24.167
How do you feel?


01:51:36.501 --> 01:51:37.501
Not in my hospital.


01:51:37.667 --> 01:51:39.751
I'll kill you first,
don't worry.


01:51:44.626 --> 01:51:47.209
What's with the sign language?


01:51:48.959 --> 01:51:51.292
Open your mouth, lazy bum!


01:51:53.959 --> 01:51:55.417
(wheezing):
It's…


01:51:57.001 --> 01:51:57.834
so…


01:52:01.542 --> 01:52:03.126
fucking…


01:52:04.084 --> 01:52:05.667
painful.


01:52:08.501 --> 01:52:09.709
I'll up your morphine.


01:52:10.542 --> 01:52:13.584
I read about a new experimental
combo that apparently…


01:52:28.084 --> 01:52:29.792
Don't…


01:52:31.126 --> 01:52:34.126
wake me up…


01:52:37.209 --> 01:52:39.209
this time…


01:52:56.167 --> 01:52:57.251
You idiot!


01:52:57.376 --> 01:52:58.876
(Amin chuckles)


01:52:58.959 --> 01:53:00.709
(laughing):
You're such an idiot!


01:53:16.792 --> 01:53:18.209
(Amin gasps)


01:53:22.792 --> 01:53:24.792
(monitor alarm beeping)


01:53:26.834 --> 01:53:28.251
Hey.


01:53:28.334 --> 01:53:31.126
What are you doing?
Amin, don't go!


01:53:31.251 --> 01:53:32.501
(Mum gasps)


01:53:34.959 --> 01:53:36.959
(monitor beeping slowly)


01:53:57.709 --> 01:53:59.709
(flatlining tone)


01:54:23.001 --> 01:54:25.001
(flatlining continues)


01:54:32.001 --> 01:54:34.001
(crying softly)


01:54:34.084 --> 01:54:36.084
<i>(waves crashing)</i>


01:54:43.417 --> 01:54:44.376
ALPHA: <i>Mum…</i>


01:54:47.417 --> 01:54:50.001
(waves crashing in distance)


01:54:50.084 --> 01:54:50.917
Are you awake?


01:54:55.959 --> 01:54:57.626
(shushes)


01:55:00.001 --> 01:55:01.876
He can't stay with us anymore.


01:55:09.709 --> 01:55:11.501
Let him sleep.


01:55:13.376 --> 01:55:15.251
Then we'll take him home.


01:55:17.084 --> 01:55:18.042
No.


01:55:20.709 --> 01:55:22.251
I'm too young.


01:55:26.542 --> 01:55:28.626
Even you said so, remember?


01:55:36.459 --> 01:55:38.334
I'm too young, Mum, I can't.


01:55:49.751 --> 01:55:51.501
(Mum crying)


01:56:07.084 --> 01:56:10.584
(sobbing)


01:56:13.917 --> 01:56:15.334
I know, Mum.


01:56:19.167 --> 01:56:20.876
It's over now.


01:56:21.626 --> 01:56:23.084
It's in the past.


01:56:26.751 --> 01:56:28.876
And you did everything right.


01:56:42.626 --> 01:56:44.626
(singing "A Vava Inouva" in Kabyle)


01:57:12.876 --> 01:57:14.876
- (continues singing)
- (sighs deeply)


01:57:18.417 --> 01:57:20.417
<i>(Alpha continues singing)</i>


01:57:28.626 --> 01:57:30.626
<i>(continues singing)</i>


01:57:57.334 --> 01:57:58.584
Are you okay?


01:57:59.501 --> 01:58:00.376
Yeah.


01:58:16.667 --> 01:58:19.126
Do you understand when I speak?


01:58:23.001 --> 01:58:24.834
It's just the song.


01:58:35.959 --> 01:58:38.209
I'm taking you home,
my brother.


01:58:38.292 --> 01:58:40.292
("Allegretto" from Beethoven's
<i>Symphony No. 7</i> playing)


01:58:42.334 --> 01:58:44.334
(wind whistling)


01:59:10.792 --> 01:59:12.792
♪♪


01:59:33.501 --> 01:59:35.917
We were too young too,
you know.


02:00:00.584 --> 02:00:02.584
♪♪


02:00:06.251 --> 02:00:07.501
(door opens)


02:00:09.959 --> 02:00:10.959
(door closes)


02:00:40.292 --> 02:00:42.292
♪♪


02:01:07.667 --> 02:01:09.667
♪♪


02:01:34.626 --> 02:01:36.626
♪♪


02:02:04.584 --> 02:02:06.584
♪♪


02:02:10.751 --> 02:02:12.751
♪♪


02:02:39.251 --> 02:02:41.417
♪♪


02:02:43.667 --> 02:02:45.667
("Allegretto" ends)


02:02:45.751 --> 02:02:48.292
♪♪


02:03:17.834 --> 02:03:20.417
♪♪


02:03:48.126 --> 02:03:50.292
♪♪


02:04:20.251 --> 02:04:22.251
♪♪


02:04:52.209 --> 02:04:54.209
♪♪


02:05:24.167 --> 02:05:26.167
♪♪


02:05:56.126 --> 02:05:58.126
♪♪


02:06:28.084 --> 02:06:30.084
♪♪


02:07:00.042 --> 02:07:02.042
♪♪


02:07:32.001 --> 02:07:34.001
♪♪


02:07:59.917 --> 02:08:01.917
(music ends)

